(448316, 41992, 12448, '<td valign="top">Why yes it is!  But yo can''t really tell what part of your body it''s on.  I think if you had pulled back and shown a little bit more of where it was and the clarity was there, the bottom line is very sharp while the top line is very fuzzy.  I do like the way the run angled across the shot, takes you from one side to the other.  Starting with a 4, will be back before the end of the challenge.</td>', 'Why yes it is!  But yo can''t really tell what part of your body it''s on.  I think if you had pulled back and shown a little bit more of where it was and the clarity was there, the bottom line is very sharp while the top line is very fuzzy.  I do like the way the run angled across the shot, takes you from one side to the other.  Starting with a 4, will be back before the end of the challenge.', '2003-10-13 02:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
