(448373, 41955, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very much light the coloring of the photo.  Normally however, the very white (blown out I think its called?) area would be very distracting to me, but with the richness in color and the very metallic look of the composition, I think it works - it wouldn''t hurt if it were a little less glaring though.  All in all, an excellent submission.   7</td>', 'Very much light the coloring of the photo.  Normally however, the very white (blown out I think its called?) area would be very distracting to me, but with the richness in color and the very metallic look of the composition, I think it works - it wouldn''t hurt if it were a little less glaring though.  All in all, an excellent submission.   7', '2003-10-13 03:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(448375, 41533, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, the subject in general is a little over-done, but the inherent interest due to the color and design of the flowers makes the photo stand out.  I also like the balanced aspect of it with the furled and unfurled flowers.  Nice Job!  7</td>', 'Nice photo, the subject in general is a little over-done, but the inherent interest due to the color and design of the flowers makes the photo stand out.  I also like the balanced aspect of it with the furled and unfurled flowers.  Nice Job!  7', '2003-10-13 03:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
