(448388, 41849, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  Captures the essence of exposed very well, I even light the soft focus/lighting on the top of the box.  I wish a little bit more of the bottom of the box (in front) was visible or more defined, but that may not have been possible.  Great, unique idea.  7</td>', 'Nice photo.  Captures the essence of exposed very well, I even light the soft focus/lighting on the top of the box.  I wish a little bit more of the bottom of the box (in front) was visible or more defined, but that may not have been possible.  Great, unique idea.  7', '2003-10-13 03:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(448390, 41952, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea!  I love the vivid primary colors playing off each other and the black.  The hand seems a bit unfocused, but since my attention is drawn towards the paint cans, that isn''t a huge deal for me.  Great use of space as well.  7</td>', 'Wonderful idea!  I love the vivid primary colors playing off each other and the black.  The hand seems a bit unfocused, but since my attention is drawn towards the paint cans, that isn''t a huge deal for me.  Great use of space as well.  7', '2003-10-13 03:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
