(448403, 41980, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice idea!  I''m guessing that''s a wire whisk over top, if so it helps tie the whole cooking aspect of the piece together as well as adding a bit of a covering/barrier as if to keep some of the recipe hidden, at least that''s what I got from it.  I tend to not like photos that are mostly words, but this one works well.  7</td>', 'Nice idea!  I''m guessing that''s a wire whisk over top, if so it helps tie the whole cooking aspect of the piece together as well as adding a bit of a covering/barrier as if to keep some of the recipe hidden, at least that''s what I got from it.  I tend to not like photos that are mostly words, but this one works well.  7', '2003-10-13 03:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(448405, 41958, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea. Excellent execution, well lit, great colours and what a lovely label. It''s a winner!  [10]</td>', 'Very nice idea. Excellent execution, well lit, great colours and what a lovely label. It''s a winner!  [10]', '2003-10-13 03:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(448406, 41271, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image!  The soft focus in the right hand corner is a bit distracting, but the frog''s eyes keep drawing my attention away from it so the negative impact is much less than it could be.  I do find the thicker border a bit too much, but the photo all together, lighting, subject works great for the challenge and as a photo on its own merit.  Bumping up the vote one to an 8</td>', 'Wonderful image!  The soft focus in the right hand corner is a bit distracting, but the frog''s eyes keep drawing my attention away from it so the negative impact is much less than it could be.  I do find the thicker border a bit too much, but the photo all together, lighting, subject works great for the challenge and as a photo on its own merit.  Bumping up the vote one to an 8', '2003-10-13 03:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(448408, 41041, 12902, '<td valign="top">One doesn''t need to know much to recognize a good photo. This one deserves a ribbon. As for me... the blue ribbon. I hope everybody will see the revealing beauty and vote accordingly. :) Good luck!</td>', 'One doesn''t need to know much to recognize a good photo. This one deserves a ribbon. As for me... the blue ribbon. I hope everybody will see the revealing beauty and vote accordingly. :) Good luck!', '2003-10-13 03:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(448409, 41923, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very nice rendition of the challenge.  The broken nut is in great focus, I also like the use of the leaf as background, keeps it nicely organic.  The color of the chestnuts? against the green leaf gives it a bit more pop as well.  Well done.  7</td>', 'Very nice rendition of the challenge.  The broken nut is in great focus, I also like the use of the leaf as background, keeps it nicely organic.  The color of the chestnuts? against the green leaf gives it a bit more pop as well.  Well done.  7', '2003-10-13 03:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(448413, 41818, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective of this shot, the tree in the background gives the photo a bit of a story - can easily imagine this nut having dropped from it..  The sunlight coming in and giving that sheen would normally be a bit distracting but it works here for me.  Good colors, very solid photograph.  7</td>', 'I like the perspective of this shot, the tree in the background gives the photo a bit of a story - can easily imagine this nut having dropped from it..  The sunlight coming in and giving that sheen would normally be a bit distracting but it works here for me.  Good colors, very solid photograph.  7', '2003-10-13 03:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(448415, 42013, 12902, '<td valign="top">I love the photo... And the subject is so cute... This is one of the views that makes you smile with your heart. Thank you for making me smile and good luck!</td>', 'I love the photo... And the subject is so cute... This is one of the views that makes you smile with your heart. Thank you for making me smile and good luck!', '2003-10-13 03:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
