(448552, 41874, 772, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot... The fox is a beautiful creature.  This is also a great subject for ''exposed''.  It''s rare that I see a fox in my area, but they do exist.  I see one occasionally crossing my driveway as I come in late at night sometimes...</td>', 'Excellent shot... The fox is a beautiful creature.  This is also a great subject for ''exposed''.  It''s rare that I see a fox in my area, but they do exist.  I see one occasionally crossing my driveway as I come in late at night sometimes...', '2003-10-13 07:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(448555, 41948, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting filter effect, but the photo doesn''t appeal to me subjectively.  The filter is the main point of interest here rather than the scene itself.</td>', 'This is an interesting filter effect, but the photo doesn''t appeal to me subjectively.  The filter is the main point of interest here rather than the scene itself.', '2003-10-13 07:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(448556, 42024, 772, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, the color shifting in this image isn''t really adding much to the impact of the photo.  It creates something ''different'' but I am having trouble understanding or finding the purpose in it.  Maybe shifting to a darker color that created more contrast would be interesting.</td>', 'In my opinion, the color shifting in this image isn''t really adding much to the impact of the photo.  It creates something ''different'' but I am having trouble understanding or finding the purpose in it.  Maybe shifting to a darker color that created more contrast would be interesting.', '2003-10-13 07:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(448562, 41830, 7086, '<td valign="top">Appears to be oversharpened, a different colour background would have helped the glass stand out.</td>', 'Appears to be oversharpened, a different colour background would have helped the glass stand out.', '2003-10-13 07:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
