(448616, 41958, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is one of the two tens I gave in the exposed challenge. The set-up and composition was the first thing that hit me when I clicked on the thumbnail. Secondly, the play of lights and shadow, which is very effective here. Thirdly the reflections of the bottles in the glass. All these points work in harmony together producing this wonderful pic. My hat off to you. This looks very much like the style of jjbeguin - 10</td>', 'This is one of the two tens I gave in the exposed challenge. The set-up and composition was the first thing that hit me when I clicked on the thumbnail. Secondly, the play of lights and shadow, which is very effective here. Thirdly the reflections of the bottles in the glass. All these points work in harmony together producing this wonderful pic. My hat off to you. This looks very much like the style of jjbeguin - 10', '2003-10-13 09:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(448618, 42008, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is my second of only two tens I gave out for this challenge. For me it is an original idea, it is always good seeing something different in a challenge and this certainly is different. The color of the pumpkin and it''s content are very crisp and strong and work in fantastically with the white background. If this pic doesn''t get a ribbon I will eat that pumpkin of yours personally :-)</td>', 'This is my second of only two tens I gave out for this challenge. For me it is an original idea, it is always good seeing something different in a challenge and this certainly is different. The color of the pumpkin and it''s content are very crisp and strong and work in fantastically with the white background. If this pic doesn''t get a ribbon I will eat that pumpkin of yours personally :-)', '2003-10-13 09:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
