(448660, 42039, 8522, '<td valign="top">Well taken picture, good lighting, effective backgound, fits the challenge. The choice of subject doesn''t do much for me personally though. It just looks like you''re showing off your new gadget! 8</td>', 'Well taken picture, good lighting, effective backgound, fits the challenge. The choice of subject doesn''t do much for me personally though. It just looks like you''re showing off your new gadget! 8', '2003-10-13 10:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(448664, 41849, 8522, '<td valign="top">Creative idea, a bit too NeatImaged for me though. Not sure about your title... I''d have liked to interpret the shot differently, perhaps a sense of mystery would be good here by not stating what you think is in the box.<br/>I think the top-left/ bottom right diagonal is stronger when using a diagonal as the basis of your composition.<br/>Perhaps magenta was the wrong colour to push in Photoshop, it works well inside the box, but makes the outside look like there is a bad colour cast to the shot.<br/>Score: 6</td>', 'Creative idea, a bit too NeatImaged for me though. Not sure about your title... I''d have liked to interpret the shot differently, perhaps a sense of mystery would be good here by not stating what you think is in the box.I think the top-left/ bottom right diagonal is stronger when using a diagonal as the basis of your composition.Perhaps magenta was the wrong colour to push in Photoshop, it works well inside the box, but makes the outside look like there is a bad colour cast to the shot.Score: 6', '2003-10-13 10:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
