(448715, 41818, 10686, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot. The only thing I don''t like is the very soft and bright blade of grass in the lower right hand corner. I think this shot would be better without it.</td>', 'I like this one a lot. The only thing I don''t like is the very soft and bright blade of grass in the lower right hand corner. I think this shot would be better without it.', '2003-10-13 11:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
