(448839, 42015, 327, '<td valign="top">This was a good idea, the color is also good. The problem is that it looks very over sharpened. I do think it meets the challenge.</td>', 'This was a good idea, the color is also good. The problem is that it looks very over sharpened. I do think it meets the challenge.', '2003-10-13 13:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
