(448845, 42013, 327, '<td valign="top">Awwwhaaaa so sweet. This little piggy went to......lol Darling feet. I think this fits the challenge. I would only say the focus is a bit soft and the light gives the skin tone a bit too much red and yellow cast.</td>', 'Awwwhaaaa so sweet. This little piggy went to......lol Darling feet. I think this fits the challenge. I would only say the focus is a bit soft and the light gives the skin tone a bit too much red and yellow cast.', '2003-10-13 13:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
