(449037, 41577, 7778, '<td valign="top">By far, the most striking image in this... tepid challenge, IMO.<br/> <br/>Excellent lighting/adjustments under what appear to be difficult conditions. A great find and apt choice of subject. With the dof not too narrow, this crips, detailed image would make a superb illustration as well. <br/> <br/>Considering what else has been submitted, and putting no more than a little faith in the voters, there really is no competition for this photo. Outstanding!</td>', 'By far, the most striking image in this... tepid challenge, IMO. Excellent lighting/adjustments under what appear to be difficult conditions. A great find and apt choice of subject. With the dof not too narrow, this crips, detailed image would make a superb illustration as well.  Considering what else has been submitted, and putting no more than a little faith in the voters, there really is no competition for this photo. Outstanding!', '2003-10-13 15:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
