(449099, 42032, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but somehow the lusciousness of the inside of the orange doesn''t come through. I think removing the white under peel would make for a more attractive photo, and possbly a little less contrast.</td>', 'I like the idea, but somehow the lusciousness of the inside of the orange doesn''t come through. I think removing the white under peel would make for a more attractive photo, and possbly a little less contrast.', '2003-10-13 16:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(449100, 41960, 12448, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful shot, the focus, the lighting, the detail is fantastic.  I love the concept, exposing the inside, I really can''t find anything wrong with the shot or the idea.  A 10!</td>', 'What a beautiful shot, the focus, the lighting, the detail is fantastic.  I love the concept, exposing the inside, I really can''t find anything wrong with the shot or the idea.  A 10!', '2003-10-13 16:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(449102, 41474, 12448, '<td valign="top">Oh what I wouldn''t do to be able to do this to the guy who says that line, LOL!  A great idea, exposing the inside of the cell phone, great concept, good follow through on the shot.  The image itself, at first glance looks close to perfect but with a little more examination, the DOF on the top is a tad distracting and the darkness on the upper left keeps trying to pull me out of the shot but the colors of the front of the phone fight back nicely.  I''m starting this one at an 8, will be back.</td>', 'Oh what I wouldn''t do to be able to do this to the guy who says that line, LOL!  A great idea, exposing the inside of the cell phone, great concept, good follow through on the shot.  The image itself, at first glance looks close to perfect but with a little more examination, the DOF on the top is a tad distracting and the darkness on the upper left keeps trying to pull me out of the shot but the colors of the front of the phone fight back nicely.  I''m starting this one at an 8, will be back.', '2003-10-13 16:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(449103, 41955, 12448, '<td valign="top">Quite a few harddrives in this challenge and the great part is everyone approached them differently!  This is a wonderful shot, the sharpness is a bit much for me but the colors are wonderful.  The arm seems a bit too bright but that is a bit of an advantage too as it keeps me in the shot and pulls me towards the center with it''s line.  Starting with an 8, I''ll be back.</td>', 'Quite a few harddrives in this challenge and the great part is everyone approached them differently!  This is a wonderful shot, the sharpness is a bit much for me but the colors are wonderful.  The arm seems a bit too bright but that is a bit of an advantage too as it keeps me in the shot and pulls me towards the center with it''s line.  Starting with an 8, I''ll be back.', '2003-10-13 16:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(449107, 42024, 12448, '<td valign="top">A wonderful idea, the star of the apple for the challenge.  But the colors really threw me at first, changing the color of the seeds and the edges was a bit disconcernting at first but the more I look at it, the more I like it at the same time!  The bluish/green in the upper corners is a bit distracting, maybe a slightly tighter crop?  Also the yellow across the bottom left corner.  I''m starting this one at a 7, I''ll be back to study it more later.</td>', 'A wonderful idea, the star of the apple for the challenge.  But the colors really threw me at first, changing the color of the seeds and the edges was a bit disconcernting at first but the more I look at it, the more I like it at the same time!  The bluish/green in the upper corners is a bit distracting, maybe a slightly tighter crop?  Also the yellow across the bottom left corner.  I''m starting this one at a 7, I''ll be back to study it more later.', '2003-10-13 16:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(449108, 41772, 12448, '<td valign="top">Good question!  Excellent concept for the challenge, especially for this site!  I love the colors in this shot, the reflections are fantastic and the gold on the film case is so perfect considering the name of the film!  I really cannot find anything wrong with this shot!  A 10!</td>', 'Good question!  Excellent concept for the challenge, especially for this site!  I love the colors in this shot, the reflections are fantastic and the gold on the film case is so perfect considering the name of the film!  I really cannot find anything wrong with this shot!  A 10!', '2003-10-13 16:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(449109, 41988, 12448, '<td valign="top">On the poker table perhaps? :)  This is a wonderful idea, cracking the shell and exposing the nuts inside!  Just like people! :)  I will admit though that the random pattern of the peanuts throws me off a bit and the cropping, the cutting off of the shells is a bit off balancing to me since the main subject is so centered, maybe having the main subject just slightly off center a bit would have balanced it more for m.  I love the colors inthe shot and the detail is fantastic.  I''m starting this with a 7, I''ll be back to look again.</td>', 'On the poker table perhaps? :)  This is a wonderful idea, cracking the shell and exposing the nuts inside!  Just like people! :)  I will admit though that the random pattern of the peanuts throws me off a bit and the cropping, the cutting off of the shells is a bit off balancing to me since the main subject is so centered, maybe having the main subject just slightly off center a bit would have balanced it more for m.  I love the colors inthe shot and the detail is fantastic.  I''m starting this with a 7, I''ll be back to look again.', '2003-10-13 16:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(449111, 41772, 772, '<td valign="top">Beautiful execution and great job with the lighting...</td>', 'Beautiful execution and great job with the lighting...', '2003-10-13 16:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(449113, 42039, 12448, '<td valign="top">When I first saw this in the thumbnail shots I thought for sure it was a reversed image or a mirrored image but now that I can see it closer I see it''s a hand held computer!  YIKES, my big ole'' fingers would never make it on that keyboard, LOL!<br/> <br/>I love this shot overall, the cropping, the angle, it takes you from one side to the other while taking you from bottom to top or reverse.  The background is a bit off to me, I''m not sure what I would suggest, maybe more white or even black against the silver to really make it pop out?  I''m starting with a 9, will be back to look some more.</td>', 'When I first saw this in the thumbnail shots I thought for sure it was a reversed image or a mirrored image but now that I can see it closer I see it''s a hand held computer!  YIKES, my big ole'' fingers would never make it on that keyboard, LOL! I love this shot overall, the cropping, the angle, it takes you from one side to the other while taking you from bottom to top or reverse.  The background is a bit off to me, I''m not sure what I would suggest, maybe more white or even black against the silver to really make it pop out?  I''m starting with a 9, will be back to look some more.', '2003-10-13 16:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(449118, 41901, 12448, '<td valign="top">I was thinking of an idea like this but I was going to have my daughter chew it and then take a shot of it in her mouth but then I thought, "That is rather gross!"  I like your concept much better.  The clarity and colors in this shot are as close to perfect as you could ask.  My only thing is the light.  It looks like it''s coming from the right of the shot, causing the one wrapper to be very bright but shadowing the other one.  More even lighting on this shot would have score a 10 right off the bat, I''m starting with an 8 and will be back to look again!</td>', 'I was thinking of an idea like this but I was going to have my daughter chew it and then take a shot of it in her mouth but then I thought, "That is rather gross!"  I like your concept much better.  The clarity and colors in this shot are as close to perfect as you could ask.  My only thing is the light.  It looks like it''s coming from the right of the shot, causing the one wrapper to be very bright but shadowing the other one.  More even lighting on this shot would have score a 10 right off the bat, I''m starting with an 8 and will be back to look again!', '2003-10-13 16:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(449121, 41970, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of light, but the pose seems a bit odd.  It has an interesting abstract quality to it and i believe it would make an interesting black and white as well :)</td>', 'Interesting use of light, but the pose seems a bit odd.  It has an interesting abstract quality to it and i believe it would make an interesting black and white as well :)', '2003-10-13 16:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(449125, 41577, 12448, '<td valign="top">You are the proud receipient of my 4th 10 in this challenge.  I love this shot, the light is perfect on the right, the cropping is perfect to me and the colors are fantastic!  Well done!</td>', 'You are the proud receipient of my 4th 10 in this challenge.  I love this shot, the light is perfect on the right, the cropping is perfect to me and the colors are fantastic!  Well done!', '2003-10-13 17:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(449128, 41440, 12448, '<td valign="top">I love Pomegranates!  Tell me this didn''t go to waste after you got done shooting!  LOL!  The concept is wonderful, the colors are vibrants and rich, the black background really sets off the reds.  The cropping leaves me a bit off though, if you could have included the entire bottom half and it also seems just a tad sharp in some areas but the DOF is off on the upper left of the top curve.  I''m starting this one at an 8 but will be back to drool............er, study some more ;)</td>', 'I love Pomegranates!  Tell me this didn''t go to waste after you got done shooting!  LOL!  The concept is wonderful, the colors are vibrants and rich, the black background really sets off the reds.  The cropping leaves me a bit off though, if you could have included the entire bottom half and it also seems just a tad sharp in some areas but the DOF is off on the upper left of the top curve.  I''m starting this one at an 8 but will be back to drool............er, study some more ;)', '2003-10-13 17:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(449129, 41041, 11570, '<td valign="top">Beautiful subject softly lit only let down by the DOF not letting the whole object be in focus.  Maybe a little extra sharpening to bring out the petal detail.</td>', 'Beautiful subject softly lit only let down by the DOF not letting the whole object be in focus.  Maybe a little extra sharpening to bring out the petal detail.', '2003-10-13 17:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(449131, 41730, 12448, '<td valign="top">YEAH!!  What a happy baby!  So sweet!  I had this same idea too but my son would NOT co-operate!  He loves to smile but it''s a cheezy type when he sees the camera.  <br/> <br/>As for this shot, the black and white work very well for this shot, the top of the head seems just a tad bright and glares a bit on my screen but the overall lighting is very well done, I love the shadow that falls across the face and hand.  I''m starting this shot at an 8 and will be back to admire some more!</td>', 'YEAH!!  What a happy baby!  So sweet!  I had this same idea too but my son would NOT co-operate!  He loves to smile but it''s a cheezy type when he sees the camera.   As for this shot, the black and white work very well for this shot, the top of the head seems just a tad bright and glares a bit on my screen but the overall lighting is very well done, I love the shadow that falls across the face and hand.  I''m starting this shot at an 8 and will be back to admire some more!', '2003-10-13 17:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(449133, 41739, 11570, '<td valign="top">Humourous choice of subject - certainly on challenge.<br/> <br/>Image wise the lighting is too flat -  perhaps a boost to the brightness/contrats settings could give it that bit of a lift.</td>', 'Humourous choice of subject - certainly on challenge. Image wise the lighting is too flat -  perhaps a boost to the brightness/contrats settings could give it that bit of a lift.', '2003-10-13 17:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(449136, 41952, 11570, '<td valign="top">Now how was this done?<br/> <br/>Strong primary colours and novel answer to the challenge. 10 from me.  Apart from the pure photographic excellence the "Exposed" theme has more than one interpretation.</td>', 'Now how was this done? Strong primary colours and novel answer to the challenge. 10 from me.  Apart from the pure photographic excellence the "Exposed" theme has more than one interpretation.', '2003-10-13 17:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(449137, 42041, 12448, '<td valign="top">A good concept, the inside of the computer but there is really nothing about this shot overall that really grabs me and hold my attention too long.  The cropping is well done, the lines of the shot help draw you across the picture and the colors are very bright but tow things seem off to me, one, the lack of dust but then again it could be a brand new machine and the upper right corner, if you had cropped just a tad tigher there I would have started at a higher score.  I''m starting at a 6 but I will be back to study it some more.</td>', 'A good concept, the inside of the computer but there is really nothing about this shot overall that really grabs me and hold my attention too long.  The cropping is well done, the lines of the shot help draw you across the picture and the colors are very bright but tow things seem off to me, one, the lack of dust but then again it could be a brand new machine and the upper right corner, if you had cropped just a tad tigher there I would have started at a higher score.  I''m starting at a 6 but I will be back to study it some more.', '2003-10-13 17:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(449138, 41532, 11570, '<td valign="top">I like the idea with the long exposure and change of pieces.<br/> <br/>But the large black border IMO detracts from the image message.</td>', 'I like the idea with the long exposure and change of pieces. But the large black border IMO detracts from the image message.', '2003-10-13 17:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(449139, 41380, 12448, '<td valign="top">Ah, the second 35mm film shot I''ve seen in this challenge.  I don''t know if you''ve see the other one but I like the concept of this, especially considering the site it''s on.  The clarity of the shot is wanting a bit and the film cannister is just enough out of focus to be distracting.  A black background would have worked a bit better to me but then you wouldn''t have gotten the shadows, maybe a yellow one, something a little bit less harsh though judging from your title that is what you might have been going for.  I''m starting this one at a 6 but will be back to look at it again.</td>', 'Ah, the second 35mm film shot I''ve seen in this challenge.  I don''t know if you''ve see the other one but I like the concept of this, especially considering the site it''s on.  The clarity of the shot is wanting a bit and the film cannister is just enough out of focus to be distracting.  A black background would have worked a bit better to me but then you wouldn''t have gotten the shadows, maybe a yellow one, something a little bit less harsh though judging from your title that is what you might have been going for.  I''m starting this one at a 6 but will be back to look at it again.', '2003-10-13 17:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(449140, 41400, 11570, '<td valign="top">Nicely done and idea well met.<br/> <br/>Only real "crticism" is tha the lighting is a bit on the harsh side. But exposure and composition very good.</td>', 'Nicely done and idea well met. Only real "crticism" is tha the lighting is a bit on the harsh side. But exposure and composition very good.', '2003-10-13 17:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(449145, 41950, 11570, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flora shot - sharp well exposed and DOF effective also nicely on Challenge.  Just missing a certain something that IMO makes a 10. Sorry, 9 from me</td>', 'Beautiful flora shot - sharp well exposed and DOF effective also nicely on Challenge.  Just missing a certain something that IMO makes a 10. Sorry, 9 from me', '2003-10-13 17:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(449154, 42023, 6597, '<td valign="top">a  good photo not exactly straigth easy to read and that will probable get you in trouble Can''t say that I would blame.<br/>                          Sue</td>', 'a  good photo not exactly straigth easy to read and that will probable get you in trouble Can''t say that I would blame.                          Sue', '2003-10-13 17:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(449156, 41923, 6597, '<td valign="top">This is a really good shot I especially like the way the nut is cracked ready to jump out.  9           Sue</td>', 'This is a really good shot I especially like the way the nut is cracked ready to jump out.  9           Sue', '2003-10-13 17:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(449157, 42019, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting idea :)  I like the 0/1 theme here quite a bit... that works nicely :)</td>', 'interesting idea :)  I like the 0/1 theme here quite a bit... that works nicely :)', '2003-10-13 17:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(449158, 41148, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice theme.  The composition and lighting are excellent.  I would really love to see a nice clean piece of chocolate here.  This one looks a bit ''worn'' :)</td>', 'This is a very nice theme.  The composition and lighting are excellent.  I would really love to see a nice clean piece of chocolate here.  This one looks a bit ''worn'' :)', '2003-10-13 17:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(449163, 41952, 4210, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome shot! I like it alot.</td>', 'This is an awesome shot! I like it alot.', '2003-10-13 17:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(449167, 41859, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting framing in the window... This shot seems to hold more interest for me when i cover the right edge and the top edge to remove the other windows from the composition.  There are lots of ''treasures'' to be found in store window displays :)</td>', 'Interesting framing in the window... This shot seems to hold more interest for me when i cover the right edge and the top edge to remove the other windows from the composition.  There are lots of ''treasures'' to be found in store window displays :)', '2003-10-13 17:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(449168, 41577, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting macro and good light as well...</td>', 'interesting macro and good light as well...', '2003-10-13 17:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(449171, 42041, 772, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of ''depth'' and detail available on a board like this.  It requires photographing from lower angles.  It also gives more of a three dimensional effect to the photo.</td>', 'There is a lot of ''depth'' and detail available on a board like this.  It requires photographing from lower angles.  It also gives more of a three dimensional effect to the photo.', '2003-10-13 17:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(449173, 41608, 772, '<td valign="top">I think a muted fill flash of some sort would help the exposure level on this image a bit.</td>', 'I think a muted fill flash of some sort would help the exposure level on this image a bit.', '2003-10-13 17:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(449176, 42037, 772, '<td valign="top">cute cat :)  (the gratuitous comment)</td>', 'cute cat :)  (the gratuitous comment)', '2003-10-13 17:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(449178, 41968, 772, '<td valign="top">This shot would be more interesting if something was in focus.</td>', 'This shot would be more interesting if something was in focus.', '2003-10-13 17:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(449180, 42042, 772, '<td valign="top">Compositionally, I would have framed to the right a little more to put the wheel on the left side of the image instead of dead center.  The area in front of the car is not adding any interest to this photo...</td>', 'Compositionally, I would have framed to the right a little more to put the wheel on the left side of the image instead of dead center.  The area in front of the car is not adding any interest to this photo...', '2003-10-13 17:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(449181, 41714, 772, '<td valign="top">nice use of creative lighting... good exposure :)</td>', 'nice use of creative lighting... good exposure :)', '2003-10-13 17:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(449182, 41589, 10047, '<td valign="top">Good subject. Focus is good in the mid and background. The lighting seems like it was taken indoors under flourescent lamps and maybe doesn''t do the walnuts justice.</td>', 'Good subject. Focus is good in the mid and background. The lighting seems like it was taken indoors under flourescent lamps and maybe doesn''t do the walnuts justice.', '2003-10-13 17:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(449183, 41953, 772, '<td valign="top">Very intersting use of light.  Cropping out the negative space on the right and left and making this into a ''vertical'' composition seems to work better for me.  The horizontal framing and the vertical nature of the subject seem to contradict here.</td>', 'Very intersting use of light.  Cropping out the negative space on the right and left and making this into a ''vertical'' composition seems to work better for me.  The horizontal framing and the vertical nature of the subject seem to contradict here.', '2003-10-13 17:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(449184, 42031, 772, '<td valign="top">I would prefer to see a lower angle shot on this subject so that some feeling of depth and dimension are visible in the image.</td>', 'I would prefer to see a lower angle shot on this subject so that some feeling of depth and dimension are visible in the image.', '2003-10-13 17:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(449186, 41084, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice concept and subject matter. Focus is a little soft. I might have tried a slightly darker background for contrast.</td>', 'Nice concept and subject matter. Focus is a little soft. I might have tried a slightly darker background for contrast.', '2003-10-13 17:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(449192, 42033, 10047, '<td valign="top">Focus is a little soft or there might have been a dirty pane of glass. Interesting subject.</td>', 'Focus is a little soft or there might have been a dirty pane of glass. Interesting subject.', '2003-10-13 18:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(449210, 41123, 772, '<td valign="top">I can''t really think of much to say about this photo other than it meets the challenge idea.  It doesn''t strike my interest, yet i''m sure it would for many.</td>', 'I can''t really think of much to say about this photo other than it meets the challenge idea.  It doesn''t strike my interest, yet i''m sure it would for many.', '2003-10-13 18:30:02.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(449211, 42008, 675, '<td valign="top">at least there''s one good seed in this barrel of shit we call the members challenge this week. hillarious! nice idea and exposure</td>', 'at least there''s one good seed in this barrel of shit we call the members challenge this week. hillarious! nice idea and exposure', '2003-10-13 18:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(449240, 41849, 10702, '<td valign="top">interesting</td>', 'interesting', '2003-10-13 19:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(449244, 41818, 10702, '<td valign="top">Brilliant - what a great photo. I love it.</td>', 'Brilliant - what a great photo. I love it.', '2003-10-13 19:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(449255, 41747, 10702, '<td valign="top">nice - good idea</td>', 'nice - good idea', '2003-10-13 19:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(449263, 41838, 10702, '<td valign="top">nice lighting</td>', 'nice lighting', '2003-10-13 19:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(449283, 41952, 12543, '<td valign="top">Nice! Love this one like ti see how you did that</td>', 'Nice! Love this one like ti see how you did that', '2003-10-13 19:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(449302, 41818, 12578, '<td valign="top">Awesome Picture ! The only thing that distracts me whilst looking at this shot is the very bright blade of grass on the right hand side, although with it there it isnt that distracting as it keeps me looking at the picture for longer ! :0) My particular favourite thing is the lovely flowing lines in the chestnut itself. Sheer Excellence...</td>', 'Awesome Picture ! The only thing that distracts me whilst looking at this shot is the very bright blade of grass on the right hand side, although with it there it isnt that distracting as it keeps me looking at the picture for longer ! :0) My particular favourite thing is the lovely flowing lines in the chestnut itself. Sheer Excellence...', '2003-10-13 19:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(449306, 41952, 10702, '<td valign="top">wooow - good work</td>', 'wooow - good work', '2003-10-13 19:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(449325, 41172, 10702, '<td valign="top">Like it very much how the ord reveald stands out and is almost the only one in focus. Great work.</td>', 'Like it very much how the ord reveald stands out and is almost the only one in focus. Great work.', '2003-10-13 19:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(449328, 41084, 6565, '<td valign="top">I really love the concept of this photo -- would suggest a different background, maybe a vivid turquoise paper to set off the silver and match the blue on the tags?  It really sets a mood, though, the idea of this poor naked Hershey kiss around all its clothed friends.  I like it! :)</td>', 'I really love the concept of this photo -- would suggest a different background, maybe a vivid turquoise paper to set off the silver and match the blue on the tags?  It really sets a mood, though, the idea of this poor naked Hershey kiss around all its clothed friends.  I like it! :)', '2003-10-13 19:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(449338, 41973, 12578, '<td valign="top">Mono works quite well on this even tho I thought it wouldn''t but i would have much prefered to see something else in the reflection than what i can only think is your PC monitor, It was put on a forum post last week that a certain 5 things would probably get shot quite a bit and this has happened as I have seen half a dozen of these shots, although this is one of the better ones imho I still think a really interesting / contrasting image in the reflection would have been the ticket !</td>', 'Mono works quite well on this even tho I thought it wouldn''t but i would have much prefered to see something else in the reflection than what i can only think is your PC monitor, It was put on a forum post last week that a certain 5 things would probably get shot quite a bit and this has happened as I have seen half a dozen of these shots, although this is one of the better ones imho I still think a really interesting / contrasting image in the reflection would have been the ticket !', '2003-10-13 19:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(449340, 41640, 6565, '<td valign="top">You get my vote for most creative use of standard film in a challenge this week! :)  I like the graniness of it, though I imagine some voters will not.  I think it creates a ghostly feel and you get the sense that the image is still BEING exposed, not totally there yet.  Very cool.</td>', 'You get my vote for most creative use of standard film in a challenge this week! :)  I like the graniness of it, though I imagine some voters will not.  I think it creates a ghostly feel and you get the sense that the image is still BEING exposed, not totally there yet.  Very cool.', '2003-10-13 19:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(449350, 41991, 12578, '<td valign="top">Nice to see some good use of the reflective surface here as some of the other of these shots blatently dont when it is such a useful thing. I understand it is hard to shoot one of these but perhaps there is a little too much red in it, Pulling out the backdrop just slightly would imho have been nice to see. Still a very good and promising image</td>', 'Nice to see some good use of the reflective surface here as some of the other of these shots blatently dont when it is such a useful thing. I understand it is hard to shoot one of these but perhaps there is a little too much red in it, Pulling out the backdrop just slightly would imho have been nice to see. Still a very good and promising image', '2003-10-13 19:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(449351, 41739, 6565, '<td valign="top">Although the background is a little spotty, I think this is a neat concept.  The image REALLY makes the viewer want to know what''s behind the areas you haven''t yet exposed.  Cropping is great, but the thumbs and coin look a little too under-lit (from a photography standpoint).  Hope you won! :)</td>', 'Although the background is a little spotty, I think this is a neat concept.  The image REALLY makes the viewer want to know what''s behind the areas you haven''t yet exposed.  Cropping is great, but the thumbs and coin look a little too under-lit (from a photography standpoint).  Hope you won! :)', '2003-10-13 19:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(449360, 42033, 12578, '<td valign="top">Excellent mind train you were on when you saw this and decided to shoot it, not only was it a good thought but very brave too ! I cant suggest any sort of improvements as you wouldnt be getting me that close to those swines ! ;0) Gr8 image keep it up</td>', 'Excellent mind train you were on when you saw this and decided to shoot it, not only was it a good thought but very brave too ! I cant suggest any sort of improvements as you wouldnt be getting me that close to those swines ! ;0) Gr8 image keep it up', '2003-10-13 19:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(449370, 41923, 12578, '<td valign="top">Good idea but somehow the composition just dosn''t sit well for me... I think it is the light source that is throwing me slightly but none the less its a good image :0)</td>', 'Good idea but somehow the composition just dosn''t sit well for me... I think it is the light source that is throwing me slightly but none the less its a good image :0)', '2003-10-13 19:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(449387, 41084, 12578, '<td valign="top">I love these Chocs ! Only had them twice from when rellies have been to Frisco as I live in UK but they are gr8 :0) Anhyhow onto the shot... I do like the idea and the shot only i feel that if you had of shot it on any sort of fabric than white ( or black ) it would have been a much bolder statement... With the white fabric I feel you are losing alot of the foil reflection that could be impacting on the viewer, if you were struggling for fabric even a cream one would have made a little more impact or try bed linen ! ? Excellent and Original concept tho ! :0)</td>', 'I love these Chocs ! Only had them twice from when rellies have been to Frisco as I live in UK but they are gr8 :0) Anhyhow onto the shot... I do like the idea and the shot only i feel that if you had of shot it on any sort of fabric than white ( or black ) it would have been a much bolder statement... With the white fabric I feel you are losing alot of the foil reflection that could be impacting on the viewer, if you were struggling for fabric even a cream one would have made a little more impact or try bed linen ! ? Excellent and Original concept tho ! :0)', '2003-10-13 19:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(449391, 42008, 10702, '<td valign="top">hehe - funny</td>', 'hehe - funny', '2003-10-13 19:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(449392, 41991, 10702, '<td valign="top">nice one - love the name also.</td>', 'nice one - love the name also.', '2003-10-13 19:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(449396, 41748, 12578, '<td valign="top">imho i think it is too dark and would have been gr8 if you had used the reflective surface of the HDD to a greater advantage. Good crisp image though.</td>', 'imho i think it is too dark and would have been gr8 if you had used the reflective surface of the HDD to a greater advantage. Good crisp image though.', '2003-10-13 19:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
