(449575, 42037, 12448, '<td valign="top">And what a cutie he/she is!  Mine do the same thing, hide in the basket and then you wonder why it''s so heavy when you pick it up! :)<br/> <br/>As for the shot, at first it threw me, not exactly sure why, maybe the way the clothes are wrapped around the cat and kinda wirl around in the shot.  If you could have gotten the cat to look directly at you the shot would be close to perfect but again, I know how difficult that can be!  Also if the cat wasn''t quite so centered I would like it more,  a little bit more cropping on the right side, then you wouldn''t lose the wirl and flow of the shot.  I''m starting with a 6 on this one but will be back to look at it again.</td>', 'And what a cutie he/she is!  Mine do the same thing, hide in the basket and then you wonder why it''s so heavy when you pick it up! :) As for the shot, at first it threw me, not exactly sure why, maybe the way the clothes are wrapped around the cat and kinda wirl around in the shot.  If you could have gotten the cat to look directly at you the shot would be close to perfect but again, I know how difficult that can be!  Also if the cat wasn''t quite so centered I would like it more,  a little bit more cropping on the right side, then you wouldn''t lose the wirl and flow of the shot.  I''m starting with a 6 on this one but will be back to look at it again.', '2003-10-13 22:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(449578, 42042, 258, '<td valign="top">Does not meet the challenge</td>', 'Does not meet the challenge', '2003-10-13 22:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
