(449581, 42000, 12448, '<td valign="top">This made me think of the old reel to reel tapes that my grandfather used to send to us when I was little!  Excellent cropping, the perfect circle would have hurt this shot for me, though I would have liked to see the complete squares on the top and bottom left.  The angle works well also for me, the way it fades away and goes just out of focus works very well and the lighting, the way it almost cuts the reel in half is wonderful.  I''m starting this at an 8 but will be back.</td>', 'This made me think of the old reel to reel tapes that my grandfather used to send to us when I was little!  Excellent cropping, the perfect circle would have hurt this shot for me, though I would have liked to see the complete squares on the top and bottom left.  The angle works well also for me, the way it fades away and goes just out of focus works very well and the lighting, the way it almost cuts the reel in half is wonderful.  I''m starting this at an 8 but will be back.', '2003-10-13 22:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(449582, 41970, 258, '<td valign="top">NIcely done!</td>', 'NIcely done!', '2003-10-13 22:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
