(449872, 41952, 8522, '<td valign="top">Superb shot, my favourite this challenge. I really want to know how you achieved this. Great composition and lighting. Fantastic concept. 10</td>', 'Superb shot, my favourite this challenge. I really want to know how you achieved this. Great composition and lighting. Fantastic concept. 10', '2003-10-14 09:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(449873, 42030, 8522, '<td valign="top">I had given this shot a 10, but after much thought decided to reduce the score to a 7, because I don''t think it meets the challenge. Without the title, I''d be struggling to work out the relevance. It is one of my favourite shots this challenge though... the symmetry works well here as well as the background pattern and textures. I like the blue duotone. I just wish it fitted the challenge better.</td>', 'I had given this shot a 10, but after much thought decided to reduce the score to a 7, because I don''t think it meets the challenge. Without the title, I''d be struggling to work out the relevance. It is one of my favourite shots this challenge though... the symmetry works well here as well as the background pattern and textures. I like the blue duotone. I just wish it fitted the challenge better.', '2003-10-14 09:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(449874, 42026, 8522, '<td valign="top">A good macro, effective lighting and colour. I like the composition. One of my favourites. 9<br/>Edit: Seems like the comments marked as helpful are very arbitrary. Two comments below are almost identical, but only one is marked as helpful. Very odd.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-10-20 06:22:18.</i></td>', 'A good macro, effective lighting and colour. I like the composition. One of my favourites. 9Edit: Seems like the comments marked as helpful are very arbitrary. Two comments below are almost identical, but only one is marked as helpful. Very odd.', '2003-10-14 09:49:19.000000', '2003-10-20 07:22:18.000000', 1),
