(449880, 41954, 7263, '<td valign="top">Good Points: nice story behind the image<br/>Bad Points: under exposed, and dull, could have got closer so the writing was clearer perhaps.<br/>Score:2</td>', 'Good Points: nice story behind the imageBad Points: under exposed, and dull, could have got closer so the writing was clearer perhaps.Score:2', '2003-10-14 10:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(449897, 42041, 12578, '<td valign="top">Thought of shooting this myself but changed my mind last minute, the only thing i can see that is letting you down here is the fact that there is no real focal point for me... I am looking at both the Brown and Orange bits. perhaps an even closer shot of the main board itself and the PCI slots getting a little blurry in the background ?</td>', 'Thought of shooting this myself but changed my mind last minute, the only thing i can see that is letting you down here is the fact that there is no real focal point for me... I am looking at both the Brown and Orange bits. perhaps an even closer shot of the main board itself and the PCI slots getting a little blurry in the background ?', '2003-10-14 10:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
