(450135, 42015, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting idea but the image seems to be way over sharpened or something... maybe a little too strong on some level adjustmens as well...</td>', 'This is an interesting idea but the image seems to be way over sharpened or something... maybe a little too strong on some level adjustmens as well...', '2003-10-14 14:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(450162, 41747, 12448, '<td valign="top">Hahaha, very cute concept on the challenge.  I love it.  The clarity of the shot is wonderful, you can see each little cog and part inside the watch, no clare on the front and you can tell you kept the crystal on because of the small magnified area on the top.  My only problem with the shot is the left side, it looks to bright compared to the right for my taste, if the light was more balanced this would have gotten a 10 right off the bat, as is, I''m starting with an 8.</td>', 'Hahaha, very cute concept on the challenge.  I love it.  The clarity of the shot is wonderful, you can see each little cog and part inside the watch, no clare on the front and you can tell you kept the crystal on because of the small magnified area on the top.  My only problem with the shot is the left side, it looks to bright compared to the right for my taste, if the light was more balanced this would have gotten a 10 right off the bat, as is, I''m starting with an 8.', '2003-10-14 15:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(450178, 41849, 12661, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and nice composition. The image appears a bit over softened however.</td>', 'Nice idea and nice composition. The image appears a bit over softened however.', '2003-10-14 15:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
