(450184, 41996, 772, '<td valign="top">Good use of color, but the nuts seem a bit odd to my senses.  They don''t look appealing.</td>', 'Good use of color, but the nuts seem a bit odd to my senses.  They don''t look appealing.', '2003-10-14 15:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
