(450239, 42027, 11923, '<td valign="top">This is a nice landscape, the color spectrum is intriguing.  I did find it a bit washed out though - not as vivid as I would''ve preferred/expected.   The branches in the foreground detracts some as well.  5</td>', 'This is a nice landscape, the color spectrum is intriguing.  I did find it a bit washed out though - not as vivid as I would''ve preferred/expected.   The branches in the foreground detracts some as well.  5', '2003-10-14 16:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(450248, 41992, 11923, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge, but I find the image a little flat.  The hand in the bottom left corner detracts.  I think the black, flesh, black look would''ve been great, but the tattoo is a tad bit unsharp to me - it being the focus of the photo I think it should really pop or be crisp.  The colors of the tattoo are great though, contrast well with the surrounding flesh &amp; black colors.  4</td>', 'Fits the challenge, but I find the image a little flat.  The hand in the bottom left corner detracts.  I think the black, flesh, black look would''ve been great, but the tattoo is a tad bit unsharp to me - it being the focus of the photo I think it should really pop or be crisp.  The colors of the tattoo are great though, contrast well with the surrounding flesh & black colors.  4', '2003-10-14 16:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
