(450430, 42004, 9411, '<td valign="top">Ok, this one is just plain weird... I like it! You obviously have a very strange view of the world. again, I like it!  <br/>Re: the image. It''s too centered for my taste. I prefer off centre subjects, but that''s me. Good focus, colour and DOF. More negative space would have aided the artistic composition.  6 for being able to stuff all those kittens in there and getting them to sit still.. &lt;&lt;G&gt;&gt;</td>', 'Ok, this one is just plain weird... I like it! You obviously have a very strange view of the world. again, I like it!  Re: the image. It''s too centered for my taste. I prefer off centre subjects, but that''s me. Good focus, colour and DOF. More negative space would have aided the artistic composition.  6 for being able to stuff all those kittens in there and getting them to sit still.. <<G>>', '2003-10-14 19:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(450431, 41975, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lighting too spot focused on petals - the greenery seems to fall out of the light into the darkness. Perhaps that''s a deliberate choice but it doesn''t add anything to me. Nor does the central (somewhat stagnant ) composition. I think I can see the idea you were striving for (a simple elegance with limited but vibrant colours) but the composition and lighting don''t quite pull that off for me.<br/>:o)</td>', 'Lighting too spot focused on petals - the greenery seems to fall out of the light into the darkness. Perhaps that''s a deliberate choice but it doesn''t add anything to me. Nor does the central (somewhat stagnant ) composition. I think I can see the idea you were striving for (a simple elegance with limited but vibrant colours) but the composition and lighting don''t quite pull that off for me.:o)', '2003-10-14 19:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
