(450627, 41968, 11738, '<td valign="top">Too bad this is so out of focus.  This might have been more interesting if the shot hadn''t been made so head-on.  Good idea though.  I''ve always been amazed where you can find these guys!</td>', 'Too bad this is so out of focus.  This might have been more interesting if the shot hadn''t been made so head-on.  Good idea though.  I''ve always been amazed where you can find these guys!', '2003-10-14 23:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(450628, 42029, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice bug shot.  End of stem on which butterfly is sitting seems overexposed.  Nice idea, but I''m afraid you''re going to get some "Not another bug shot" comments.</td>', 'Nice bug shot.  End of stem on which butterfly is sitting seems overexposed.  Nice idea, but I''m afraid you''re going to get some "Not another bug shot" comments.', '2003-10-14 23:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(450641, 41823, 4338, '<td valign="top">this is too funny....i love it</td>', 'this is too funny....i love it', '2003-10-14 23:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(450715, 41952, 6888, '<td valign="top">great effect, nice bright colors</td>', 'great effect, nice bright colors', '2003-10-15 00:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(450845, 41818, 8760, '<td valign="top">Excellent !!! I love the title, the sharpness, the backgroung, the "autumn" light and atmosphere... Great job !!!</td>', 'Excellent !!! I love the title, the sharpness, the backgroung, the "autumn" light and atmosphere... Great job !!!', '2003-10-15 02:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(450889, 41748, 5643, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color and contrast</td>', 'Beautiful color and contrast', '2003-10-15 04:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(450892, 42020, 5643, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done. Black background works!<br/>Great title.</td>', 'Beautifully done. Black background works!Great title.', '2003-10-15 04:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(450894, 42027, 5643, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition. A bit hazy, but very nice.</td>', 'Beautiful composition. A bit hazy, but very nice.', '2003-10-15 04:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(450895, 41714, 5643, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Very well executed.</td>', 'Excellent! Very well executed.', '2003-10-15 04:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(451025, 41874, 12733, '<td valign="top">Burglar caught. Very nice shot.</td>', 'Burglar caught. Very nice shot.', '2003-10-15 09:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(451032, 41640, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting interpretation of the challenge, and an attractive shot. It almost demands that the viewer try to visualize the positive print that would come from this negative.</td>', 'Interesting interpretation of the challenge, and an attractive shot. It almost demands that the viewer try to visualize the positive print that would come from this negative.', '2003-10-15 09:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(451038, 41532, 12733, '<td valign="top">I''m puzzled as to the relevance of the title to the photo or the theme. It''s a gorgeous piece of pottery, and the photo brings its detail out nicely.</td>', 'I''m puzzled as to the relevance of the title to the photo or the theme. It''s a gorgeous piece of pottery, and the photo brings its detail out nicely.', '2003-10-15 09:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(451041, 41067, 12733, '<td valign="top">At a time when the world is flooded with photos of whole forests in fall colors, the detail of a single leaf is a refreshing change - especially when it is this well lit and composed. I think a darker gray in the background would allevieate the amount of blank space at the top left.</td>', 'At a time when the world is flooded with photos of whole forests in fall colors, the detail of a single leaf is a refreshing change - especially when it is this well lit and composed. I think a darker gray in the background would allevieate the amount of blank space at the top left.', '2003-10-15 09:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(451049, 42024, 12733, '<td valign="top">Getting this close, with this coloring, you get an interesting abstract. Without the title I would never figure out what the subject is. The texture and shapes are excellent.</td>', 'Getting this close, with this coloring, you get an interesting abstract. Without the title I would never figure out what the subject is. The texture and shapes are excellent.', '2003-10-15 09:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(451057, 42000, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting shapes, colors and lighting. The repeated circles - and the cutting of part of the outer one - give the picture a unity that holds interest.</td>', 'Interesting shapes, colors and lighting. The repeated circles - and the cutting of part of the outer one - give the picture a unity that holds interest.', '2003-10-15 09:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(451061, 41973, 12733, '<td valign="top">Metallic parts give interesting textures, and machine parts, taken from the right angle make great compositions. Nice shot.</td>', 'Metallic parts give interesting textures, and machine parts, taken from the right angle make great compositions. Nice shot.', '2003-10-15 09:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(451072, 41988, 12733, '<td valign="top">Open nuts and sliced fruit are something of a cliche on this challenge, but this is very well done. Nice plain background, and the variety of exposure of the nuts - from untouched to completely empty - makes it original. Nice lighting and compositionl.</td>', 'Open nuts and sliced fruit are something of a cliche on this challenge, but this is very well done. Nice plain background, and the variety of exposure of the nuts - from untouched to completely empty - makes it original. Nice lighting and compositionl.', '2003-10-15 09:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(451076, 41411, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is quite a find if the title is accurate. Nice shot - it shows the skeleton clearly and is nicely composed.</td>', 'This is quite a find if the title is accurate. Nice shot - it shows the skeleton clearly and is nicely composed.', '2003-10-15 09:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(451083, 41922, 12733, '<td valign="top">What a great way to show the inside of an egg. Great exposure, color and composition. Nice shot, clever solution to the challenge.</td>', 'What a great way to show the inside of an egg. Great exposure, color and composition. Nice shot, clever solution to the challenge.', '2003-10-15 09:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(451088, 41964, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but the large uncovered spaces at the right are a bit disturbing. I think it would have been OK to crop a little tighter on that side. The loss of part of that right-hand slice might even strengthen the overall effect (I put a piece of paper over my computer screen, and I think it was an improvement). The lighting and captuere of the texture are great.</td>', 'Nice composition, but the large uncovered spaces at the right are a bit disturbing. I think it would have been OK to crop a little tighter on that side. The loss of part of that right-hand slice might even strengthen the overall effect (I put a piece of paper over my computer screen, and I think it was an improvement). The lighting and captuere of the texture are great.', '2003-10-15 09:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(451092, 41968, 12733, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, and the machinery makes an interesting composition.</td>', 'Clever idea, and the machinery makes an interesting composition.', '2003-10-15 09:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(451098, 41084, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast and composition. And the highlights on the foil wrappings are great.</td>', 'Nice contrast and composition. And the highlights on the foil wrappings are great.', '2003-10-15 09:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(451104, 42013, 12733, '<td valign="top">Cute idea and nice shot.</td>', 'Cute idea and nice shot.', '2003-10-15 10:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(451236, 41958, 12448, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea for this challenge!  If I''m reading this correctly, the old wine is now exposed to the light and to the taste buds?  I love the colors on this, the light reflecting on the date on the bottle, the curved bottles through the glass, so well done!  The only thing I would have done differently if I were able to take shots like this is crop the top to just above the top of the wine glass.  Then you can still see the dust on the top of the bottle and the bottoms of the other bottles in the upper right are quite as distracting.  A 9 for this one!</td>', 'Wonderful idea for this challenge!  If I''m reading this correctly, the old wine is now exposed to the light and to the taste buds?  I love the colors on this, the light reflecting on the date on the bottle, the curved bottles through the glass, so well done!  The only thing I would have done differently if I were able to take shots like this is crop the top to just above the top of the wine glass.  Then you can still see the dust on the top of the bottle and the bottoms of the other bottles in the upper right are quite as distracting.  A 9 for this one!', '2003-10-15 11:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(451238, 42009, 12448, '<td valign="top">So that is what it looks like! ;)  Nice shot, good idea and the lighting is very well done.  The only thing to me is the DOF or the lack of focus on the bottom of the shot and the eye looks a tad fuzzy.  Starting with a 7 but I will come back and look again!</td>', 'So that is what it looks like! ;)  Nice shot, good idea and the lighting is very well done.  The only thing to me is the DOF or the lack of focus on the bottom of the shot and the eye looks a tad fuzzy.  Starting with a 7 but I will come back and look again!', '2003-10-15 11:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(451243, 41731, 12448, '<td valign="top">A nice idea but without the title to tell me what you were going for I would be guessing that it was the sun that was being exposed from behind the clouds.  The colors are lovely, very muted, not overpowering.  The skyline actually detracts from this shot for me in the end.  I''m starting this one with a 6 but I''ll be back to look again. :)<br/></td>', 'A nice idea but without the title to tell me what you were going for I would be guessing that it was the sun that was being exposed from behind the clouds.  The colors are lovely, very muted, not overpowering.  The skyline actually detracts from this shot for me in the end.  I''m starting this one with a 6 but I''ll be back to look again. :)', '2003-10-15 11:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(451246, 41823, 12448, '<td valign="top">Ooooooooooo, Poor fishy!  I will say though that the expression is priceless, rainbow trout isn''t it?<br/> <br/>I like the concept you went for and the colors are wonderful, the clarity of the shot is also wonderful but only if there was some other way to set him up, the hand is very distracting, especially the sleeve on the top.  Maybe a different angle, because I see you couldn''t crop out the sleeve without losing the fish''s tail.  I''m starting with a 7 on this one.</td>', 'Ooooooooooo, Poor fishy!  I will say though that the expression is priceless, rainbow trout isn''t it? I like the concept you went for and the colors are wonderful, the clarity of the shot is also wonderful but only if there was some other way to set him up, the hand is very distracting, especially the sleeve on the top.  Maybe a different angle, because I see you couldn''t crop out the sleeve without losing the fish''s tail.  I''m starting with a 7 on this one.', '2003-10-15 11:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(451249, 41576, 12448, '<td valign="top">Deja Vue!  This has happened to me and man is it fustrating!  LOL!  Good idea on the challenge and the black and white works well but the contrast seems off a bit and the strap running out of the shot is a bit distracting.  The DOF is well done though, starting with a 7 on this one.</td>', 'Deja Vue!  This has happened to me and man is it fustrating!  LOL!  Good idea on the challenge and the black and white works well but the contrast seems off a bit and the strap running out of the shot is a bit distracting.  The DOF is well done though, starting with a 7 on this one.', '2003-10-15 11:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(451253, 41972, 12448, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea on this challenge!  The colors and negative space work very well on this shot.  But something is just off to me and I''m trying to decide if it''s the expression on the child''s face or the imbalance because of only one had being seen.  I''ll have to think about this and try to get back to you on that.  I''m starting with a 7 but I will be back.</td>', 'Wonderful idea on this challenge!  The colors and negative space work very well on this shot.  But something is just off to me and I''m trying to decide if it''s the expression on the child''s face or the imbalance because of only one had being seen.  I''ll have to think about this and try to get back to you on that.  I''m starting with a 7 but I will be back.', '2003-10-15 11:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(451256, 41989, 12448, '<td valign="top">Wow, this scene looks familier!  I''m in Elmira, NY and out hills look much the same right now!  I like the idea that you were going for here but the cropping of the shot is a bit too much for me, too much sky, a bit too balanced if that''s possible.  Also the tree on the left keeps trying to take me out of the shot, BAD TREE! ;)  Starting with a 5 on this but I''ll be back :)</td>', 'Wow, this scene looks familier!  I''m in Elmira, NY and out hills look much the same right now!  I like the idea that you were going for here but the cropping of the shot is a bit too much for me, too much sky, a bit too balanced if that''s possible.  Also the tree on the left keeps trying to take me out of the shot, BAD TREE! ;)  Starting with a 5 on this but I''ll be back :)', '2003-10-15 11:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(451257, 41474, 6668, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the background in this shot..a solid background would have worked better in my opinion.</td>', 'I don''t care for the background in this shot..a solid background would have worked better in my opinion.', '2003-10-15 11:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(451260, 41175, 12448, '<td valign="top">Another harddrive!  But again, done so differently from the others that I can''t complain.  The clairty on this shot if fanstastic, the colors are muted so they don''t overpower you and the light reflection is perfect, the iny bit of glare really adds to the shot and the drive is actually moving, WONDERFUL!  Another 10 for this one!</td>', 'Another harddrive!  But again, done so differently from the others that I can''t complain.  The clairty on this shot if fanstastic, the colors are muted so they don''t overpower you and the light reflection is perfect, the iny bit of glare really adds to the shot and the drive is actually moving, WONDERFUL!  Another 10 for this one!', '2003-10-15 11:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(451262, 40981, 12448, '<td valign="top">BANANA BREAD Banana!  Or Banana Cake so it''s not to Un (a) peeling, hehehe! ;)<br/> <br/>I like the idea you have here and going to black and white did not hurt this shot but the cropping is just off to me.  If you had been able to keep the top of the banana in the shot and not cut off that would raise my score and a bit more sharpness on the overall shot.  Starting with a 7 on this one.</td>', 'BANANA BREAD Banana!  Or Banana Cake so it''s not to Un (a) peeling, hehehe! ;) I like the idea you have here and going to black and white did not hurt this shot but the cropping is just off to me.  If you had been able to keep the top of the banana in the shot and not cut off that would raise my score and a bit more sharpness on the overall shot.  Starting with a 7 on this one.', '2003-10-15 11:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(451263, 41842, 6668, '<td valign="top">I really like the shot..even though I''m not sure how well it fits into the challenge.</td>', 'I really like the shot..even though I''m not sure how well it fits into the challenge.', '2003-10-15 11:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(451265, 41952, 6668, '<td valign="top">very cool...love the bright vibrant colors. 10</td>', 'very cool...love the bright vibrant colors. 10', '2003-10-15 11:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(451266, 41954, 12448, '<td valign="top">Did you really find this or was it set up?  Either way, this can be taken two ways to me, either the diary being exposed to others because it was lost (but travel diaries are usually pretty mudane) or it being exposed to the elements, much like it''s owner might have been.<br/> <br/>The shot is balanced very well to me, not centering the diary really works with this shot and at first I would say it''s a tad dark but when it''s raining it really is a bit dark isn''t it?  Very well done, good idea, good exposure overall.  A 9 for you, may be back to bump it up before I''m done.</td>', 'Did you really find this or was it set up?  Either way, this can be taken two ways to me, either the diary being exposed to others because it was lost (but travel diaries are usually pretty mudane) or it being exposed to the elements, much like it''s owner might have been. The shot is balanced very well to me, not centering the diary really works with this shot and at first I would say it''s a tad dark but when it''s raining it really is a bit dark isn''t it?  Very well done, good idea, good exposure overall.  A 9 for you, may be back to bump it up before I''m done.', '2003-10-15 11:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(451267, 41400, 6668, '<td valign="top">I think this shot would have been better with different lighting, and getting rid of the shadows.</td>', 'I think this shot would have been better with different lighting, and getting rid of the shadows.', '2003-10-15 11:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(451268, 41791, 12448, '<td valign="top">More exposed film!  But just like the harddrive they have all been done differently and each stand on their own, sorta, your''s is kinda leaning ;)  About the shot, I like the idea, the clarity is wonderful andthe lighting is fantastic.  My only gripe per say is the cropping, the film getting cut off on the right is a bit off to me but at the same time it helps you because the canister brings you into the shot and the film takes you out.  Starting with a 9 on this shot</td>', 'More exposed film!  But just like the harddrive they have all been done differently and each stand on their own, sorta, your''s is kinda leaning ;)  About the shot, I like the idea, the clarity is wonderful andthe lighting is fantastic.  My only gripe per say is the cropping, the film getting cut off on the right is a bit off to me but at the same time it helps you because the canister brings you into the shot and the film takes you out.  Starting with a 9 on this shot', '2003-10-15 11:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(451270, 41608, 6668, '<td valign="top">great idea...but the photo seems grainy..more lighting may have helped with this.</td>', 'great idea...but the photo seems grainy..more lighting may have helped with this.', '2003-10-15 11:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(451332, 41957, 11570, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp well exposed technical type shot and does meet the challange.</td>', 'Nice crisp well exposed technical type shot and does meet the challange.', '2003-10-15 13:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(451377, 41618, 4090, '<td valign="top">Great photo ... IMHO a bit contrat is needed and a wee bit tight on the crop but love it 9</td>', 'Great photo ... IMHO a bit contrat is needed and a wee bit tight on the crop but love it 9', '2003-10-15 13:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(451462, 41900, 11155, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this was previously concealed as the challenge suggests.  Exposed now perhaps, but to be concealed in the future, I think.</td>', 'I don''t think this was previously concealed as the challenge suggests.  Exposed now perhaps, but to be concealed in the future, I think.', '2003-10-15 14:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(451470, 41818, 11155, '<td valign="top">Excellent representation of "concealed now exposed".   I have no idea what this is (some sort of seed?) but the lighting is good and it fits the challenge well.  10 from me.</td>', 'Excellent representation of "concealed now exposed".   I have no idea what this is (some sort of seed?) but the lighting is good and it fits the challenge well.  10 from me.', '2003-10-15 15:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(451475, 41962, 11155, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and lighting.  Good representation of the challenge.</td>', 'Nice colors and lighting.  Good representation of the challenge.', '2003-10-15 15:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(451476, 41842, 13191, '<td valign="top">I love this picture</td>', 'I love this picture', '2003-10-15 15:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(451556, 41998, 12448, '<td valign="top">And he does have the, "BUSTED" look in his eyes, LOL!  Nice shot, excellent colors but there has been something about this shot that just doesn''t sit right, I can''t put my finger on it, I''ve come back to it about 4 times so far and I"ll be back again to see if I can figure it out.  Starting you with an 8 until I figure out what it is that doesn''t quite sit right for me.</td>', 'And he does have the, "BUSTED" look in his eyes, LOL!  Nice shot, excellent colors but there has been something about this shot that just doesn''t sit right, I can''t put my finger on it, I''ve come back to it about 4 times so far and I"ll be back again to see if I can figure it out.  Starting you with an 8 until I figure out what it is that doesn''t quite sit right for me.', '2003-10-15 18:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(451557, 42025, 12448, '<td valign="top">Ah, the lovely green pepper, chopped many of these when I worked in a Subway.  I really like the concept but the lighting leaves me a bit cold per say.  The top and upper side just seems a bit too dark to go with the rest of the shot.  Starting with a 7 on this one because the clarity and color of the rest of the shot make up for the light ;)</td>', 'Ah, the lovely green pepper, chopped many of these when I worked in a Subway.  I really like the concept but the lighting leaves me a bit cold per say.  The top and upper side just seems a bit too dark to go with the rest of the shot.  Starting with a 7 on this one because the clarity and color of the rest of the shot make up for the light ;)', '2003-10-15 18:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(451559, 41966, 12448, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful idea for the challenge.  The lighting, the colors are excellent, just the right amount of shadow on the orange.  If the entire shot could have been sharper this would have received a 10 right off the bat, going to start with an 8 and I''ll be back.</td>', 'What a wonderful idea for the challenge.  The lighting, the colors are excellent, just the right amount of shadow on the orange.  If the entire shot could have been sharper this would have received a 10 right off the bat, going to start with an 8 and I''ll be back.', '2003-10-15 18:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(451560, 41842, 12448, '<td valign="top">Nice stop action on the girl compared to the motion feel of the flowers.  I like the idea that she might have just popped up and started running but the cropping of the shot seems just off to me, if the girl was more to the right maybe?  Also the colors seem a tad off.  Starting with a 7 on this one</td>', 'Nice stop action on the girl compared to the motion feel of the flowers.  I like the idea that she might have just popped up and started running but the cropping of the shot seems just off to me, if the girl was more to the right maybe?  Also the colors seem a tad off.  Starting with a 7 on this one', '2003-10-15 18:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(451570, 42030, 6130, '<td valign="top">wonderful 10</td>', 'wonderful 10', '2003-10-15 18:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(451680, 41953, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing shot, the lines, the use of space, the lighting, the concept.  I have looked at this picture over and over again and it just keeps screaming <b>10!</b> to me!  Well done!</td>', 'This is an amazing shot, the lines, the use of space, the lighting, the concept.  I have looked at this picture over and over again and it just keeps screaming 10! to me!  Well done!', '2003-10-15 21:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(451687, 42032, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a great concept, exposing the orange and I love the way you peeled it, very inventive!  The only thing is the color of the orange, it seems a bit dark to me.  The lighting is wonderful the shadow on the right is very apeeling, :)  I''m giving this one an 8 for now but I''ll be back.</td>', 'This is a great concept, exposing the orange and I love the way you peeled it, very inventive!  The only thing is the color of the orange, it seems a bit dark to me.  The lighting is wonderful the shadow on the right is very apeeling, :)  I''m giving this one an 8 for now but I''ll be back.', '2003-10-15 21:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(451691, 41977, 12448, '<td valign="top">Okay, unless my monitor is way off, this is a lemon or grapefruit?  Because it''s coming up yellow and if it''s a lemon or grapefruit, isn''t your title a little "off" :)  Don''t you mean sour exposure? :)  As for the shot, I love it, the yellow on the blue is a wonderful contrast of primary colors and the cropping, the fuit part way out of the shot is very well done. It does seems just a tad bright to me but it might just be the yellow coloring that''s causing that effect.  I''m starting this one at an 8 but I will be back.</td>', 'Okay, unless my monitor is way off, this is a lemon or grapefruit?  Because it''s coming up yellow and if it''s a lemon or grapefruit, isn''t your title a little "off" :)  Don''t you mean sour exposure? :)  As for the shot, I love it, the yellow on the blue is a wonderful contrast of primary colors and the cropping, the fuit part way out of the shot is very well done. It does seems just a tad bright to me but it might just be the yellow coloring that''s causing that effect.  I''m starting this one at an 8 but I will be back.', '2003-10-15 21:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(451694, 41041, 12448, '<td valign="top">What beautiful colors and the DOF is wonderful!  The detail is fantastic and the top of the poppy gently resting, waiting for it to tip it off, very nice capture.  The lighting works very well with this shot, any brighter and the orange would have been too bright.  It meets the challenge and this will be the 9th 10 I''ve given in this challenge so far, well done.</td>', 'What beautiful colors and the DOF is wonderful!  The detail is fantastic and the top of the poppy gently resting, waiting for it to tip it off, very nice capture.  The lighting works very well with this shot, any brighter and the orange would have been too bright.  It meets the challenge and this will be the 9th 10 I''ve given in this challenge so far, well done.', '2003-10-15 21:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(451902, 42008, 10833, '<td valign="top">I can''t vote here.. but this is great.  I love the humor and creativity you showed here.</td>', 'I can''t vote here.. but this is great.  I love the humor and creativity you showed here.', '2003-10-16 00:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(451906, 41958, 6870, '<td valign="top">Talk about perfect light! Nice work! 9</td>', 'Talk about perfect light! Nice work! 9', '2003-10-16 00:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(451907, 41960, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun idea. I like the point of view here. Perhaps a little too light, but that''s a matter of ''taste.''</td>', 'Fun idea. I like the point of view here. Perhaps a little too light, but that''s a matter of ''taste.''', '2003-10-16 00:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(451909, 41440, 6870, '<td valign="top">I love these. I''m not sure why you cut the bottom off. Perhaps you could be more enthusiastic about cropping and get it lots closer, or step back to include the whole fruit. Nice tones and colors. Black background works well to set off the white and red of the fruit.</td>', 'I love these. I''m not sure why you cut the bottom off. Perhaps you could be more enthusiastic about cropping and get it lots closer, or step back to include the whole fruit. Nice tones and colors. Black background works well to set off the white and red of the fruit.', '2003-10-16 00:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(451910, 42000, 6870, '<td valign="top">So THAT"s what''s in there! Nice lines and colors.</td>', 'So THAT"s what''s in there! Nice lines and colors.', '2003-10-16 00:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(451922, 41714, 11738, '<td valign="top">Umm... is this your science entry?  Unless you wanted to show what the guts of tehse high-power bulbs look like.  Nice clean and clear shot.</td>', 'Umm... is this your science entry?  Unless you wanted to show what the guts of tehse high-power bulbs look like.  Nice clean and clear shot.', '2003-10-16 00:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(452009, 41411, 9411, '<td valign="top">NIce, Big, who is it?  good detail</td>', 'NIce, Big, who is it?  good detail', '2003-10-16 01:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(452362, 41962, 2764, '<td valign="top">ooh, that border is too bright - looks neon</td>', 'ooh, that border is too bright - looks neon', '2003-10-16 10:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(452369, 41962, 6668, '<td valign="top">I personally don''t care for this border at all, also I think it would have worked better with the rest of the candies unwrapped.</td>', 'I personally don''t care for this border at all, also I think it would have worked better with the rest of the candies unwrapped.', '2003-10-16 10:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(452372, 42029, 6668, '<td valign="top">Great shot..l Love the position of the butterfly and the angle of the shot.. border also works well with this shot..nice work! 9</td>', 'Great shot..l Love the position of the butterfly and the angle of the shot.. border also works well with this shot..nice work! 9', '2003-10-16 10:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(452377, 41972, 2764, '<td valign="top">Would a vertical crop be better?  Does all the negative space on the right and left contribute anything to the composition?</td>', 'Would a vertical crop be better?  Does all the negative space on the right and left contribute anything to the composition?', '2003-10-16 10:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(452379, 42014, 2764, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite this week - 10</td>', 'This is my favorite this week - 10', '2003-10-16 10:41:23.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(452381, 41953, 5728, '<td valign="top">A very well taken low key image, I like your idea of the hands holding  the stomach like that. The lighting is optimal and reveals just enough for the observer to imagine the form of the rest of the body in the darkness. In my opinion there is just a little too much darkness behind the body and the subject is too centered (8)</td>', 'A very well taken low key image, I like your idea of the hands holding  the stomach like that. The lighting is optimal and reveals just enough for the observer to imagine the form of the rest of the body in the darkness. In my opinion there is just a little too much darkness behind the body and the subject is too centered (8)', '2003-10-16 10:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(452382, 41730, 5728, '<td valign="top">A wonderful capture of emotion and the composition is spot on. The tight crop does not reduce the quality of the photo. The border does nothing for me though and it competes too much with the top of the head (8)</td>', 'A wonderful capture of emotion and the composition is spot on. The tight crop does not reduce the quality of the photo. The border does nothing for me though and it competes too much with the top of the head (8)', '2003-10-16 10:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(452384, 42030, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is good. The centering of your subject, although going against the rules of thirds etc etc, is not negative at all here. In fact I find it quite enhancing. The sepia toning is not overdone, and the border is very fitting. And that coming from someone who is not a big fan of borders anymore :-) Good symmetry....</td>', 'This is good. The centering of your subject, although going against the rules of thirds etc etc, is not negative at all here. In fact I find it quite enhancing. The sepia toning is not overdone, and the border is very fitting. And that coming from someone who is not a big fan of borders anymore :-) Good symmetry....', '2003-10-16 10:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(452385, 41991, 5728, '<td valign="top">Everything fits together harmoniously here. The red/yellow tones, the reflections and the lighting. Even the border is fitting (8)</td>', 'Everything fits together harmoniously here. The red/yellow tones, the reflections and the lighting. Even the border is fitting (8)', '2003-10-16 10:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(452390, 41964, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very good studio shot, looks like something I''d find in a supermarket brochure or stock photography catalogue. The lighting is very fitting and the set up also bang on. I can''t almost taste the juiciness of this kiwi fruit. The crop on the left side is very borderline, almost a tad too much.</td>', 'Very good studio shot, looks like something I''d find in a supermarket brochure or stock photography catalogue. The lighting is very fitting and the set up also bang on. I can''t almost taste the juiciness of this kiwi fruit. The crop on the left side is very borderline, almost a tad too much.', '2003-10-16 10:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(452400, 40981, 5728, '<td valign="top">Now that looks like an old banana :-) Personally I would have used a different background, something without a pattern on it. Also the crop is far too tight, I would have at least included all of the banana on the left hand side.</td>', 'Now that looks like an old banana :-) Personally I would have used a different background, something without a pattern on it. Also the crop is far too tight, I would have at least included all of the banana on the left hand side.', '2003-10-16 11:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(452404, 41377, 5728, '<td valign="top">The crop is too tight, I personally would have not cut off so much on the right hand side, it needs more room to breathe so to say.</td>', 'The crop is too tight, I personally would have not cut off so much on the right hand side, it needs more room to breathe so to say.', '2003-10-16 11:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(452410, 41974, 5728, '<td valign="top">The grass at the front is kind of distracting and your snail is partly hidden. A different shooting position might have worked better, or at least removing the distracting grass. I don''t think the snail would have run away that fast :-) Good usage of rule of thirds and your main subject is in focus.</td>', 'The grass at the front is kind of distracting and your snail is partly hidden. A different shooting position might have worked better, or at least removing the distracting grass. I don''t think the snail would have run away that fast :-) Good usage of rule of thirds and your main subject is in focus.', '2003-10-16 11:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(452412, 41858, 5728, '<td valign="top">Interesting macro, the color is very vibrant. The water droplets appear oversharpened to me.</td>', 'Interesting macro, the color is very vibrant. The water droplets appear oversharpened to me.', '2003-10-16 11:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(452418, 41842, 5728, '<td valign="top">You''ve cropped too closely to the girl''s head at the top. I would have placed the girl further down and a little more to the right following the rule of thirds. That would have enhanced your image immensely. I like the way you have captured her in full run with her arms in the air. It looks very natural.</td>', 'You''ve cropped too closely to the girl''s head at the top. I would have placed the girl further down and a little more to the right following the rule of thirds. That would have enhanced your image immensely. I like the way you have captured her in full run with her arms in the air. It looks very natural.', '2003-10-16 11:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(452420, 41993, 5728, '<td valign="top">Funny, but why crop out the upper legs and ear?</td>', 'Funny, but why crop out the upper legs and ear?', '2003-10-16 11:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(452488, 41830, 5728, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. Two things I''d like to critique on here though. 1) the background is not very image enhancing. I would rather have gone with something without a pattern on it, maybe some photoboard perhaps. This background has a kind of soft feel to it, which is contradictory to a broken light bulb. 2) This image is way oversharpened, a little less USM would have avoided this.</td>', 'Interesting idea. Two things I''d like to critique on here though. 1) the background is not very image enhancing. I would rather have gone with something without a pattern on it, maybe some photoboard perhaps. This background has a kind of soft feel to it, which is contradictory to a broken light bulb. 2) This image is way oversharpened, a little less USM would have avoided this.', '2003-10-16 11:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(452503, 41731, 4400, '<td valign="top">Nice sky an colour I like it 10pt</td>', 'Nice sky an colour I like it 10pt', '2003-10-16 12:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(452522, 41958, 4400, '<td valign="top">1923 not bad! this is wonderful photo, the light on the bottle  is nice!  excellent work 10pt  (if you get a ribbon then you must open the bottle!! :O)</td>', '1923 not bad! this is wonderful photo, the light on the bottle  is nice!  excellent work 10pt  (if you get a ribbon then you must open the bottle!! :O)', '2003-10-16 12:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(452577, 41989, 6668, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape shot..though I''m not sure how well it fits into the challenge without the title.</td>', 'Nice landscape shot..though I''m not sure how well it fits into the challenge without the title.', '2003-10-16 12:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(452583, 41874, 6668, '<td valign="top">great shot...love the lighting..definately meets the challenge!! Nice work! 10</td>', 'great shot...love the lighting..definately meets the challenge!! Nice work! 10', '2003-10-16 12:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(452602, 41084, 6668, '<td valign="top">nice idea...photo seems a bit dark, maybe a bit more lighting would have helped.</td>', 'nice idea...photo seems a bit dark, maybe a bit more lighting would have helped.', '2003-10-16 13:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(452608, 41411, 3569, '<td valign="top">great interpretation.</td>', 'great interpretation.', '2003-10-16 13:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(452620, 42017, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice contrasts.  I think I''d like to have seen it in the prairie instread though.</td>', 'Nice contrasts.  I think I''d like to have seen it in the prairie instread though.', '2003-10-16 13:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(452636, 41582, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.  Especially the light ground.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice lighting.  Especially the light ground.  Good job.', '2003-10-16 13:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(452642, 41400, 3569, '<td valign="top">The grain of the paper is distracting.  IMOP a smooth background would have worked better, possibly a different color.</td>', 'The grain of the paper is distracting.  IMOP a smooth background would have worked better, possibly a different color.', '2003-10-16 13:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(452644, 41972, 3569, '<td valign="top">Interestingly goo.  I like the colors.</td>', 'Interestingly goo.  I like the colors.', '2003-10-16 13:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(452711, 41067, 10263, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. The simplicity of the leaf against the white background and the complexity of the veins in the leaf make it an awesome shot.</td>', 'This is beautiful. The simplicity of the leaf against the white background and the complexity of the veins in the leaf make it an awesome shot.', '2003-10-16 14:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(452719, 41818, 10263, '<td valign="top">I like this. Horse chestnuts? I love the wood grain look of the nuts. Nice DoF. The glare and the washed out blade of grass in the foreground are a bit distracting.</td>', 'I like this. Horse chestnuts? I love the wood grain look of the nuts. Nice DoF. The glare and the washed out blade of grass in the foreground are a bit distracting.', '2003-10-16 14:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(452722, 41640, 10263, '<td valign="top">This is neat and a good interpretation of the challenge. Very creative. Good colors.</td>', 'This is neat and a good interpretation of the challenge. Very creative. Good colors.', '2003-10-16 14:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(452852, 41271, 12733, '<td valign="top">Did taking its photo bug it, or do frogs just naturally look angry. Nice shot - great colors, lighting - and amazingly close up.</td>', 'Did taking its photo bug it, or do frogs just naturally look angry. Nice shot - great colors, lighting - and amazingly close up.', '2003-10-16 16:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(452854, 41762, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the repetitive pattern formed by the posts; they seem to frame the other structures and give the picture some unity.</td>', 'I like the repetitive pattern formed by the posts; they seem to frame the other structures and give the picture some unity.', '2003-10-16 16:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(452856, 42033, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful view of something few of us ever see close up. I wouldn''t take a shot like this, except with a really long remote, but then I don''t have much occasion to deal with bees.</td>', 'This is a beautiful view of something few of us ever see close up. I wouldn''t take a shot like this, except with a really long remote, but then I don''t have much occasion to deal with bees.', '2003-10-16 16:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(452986, 42027, 12448, '<td valign="top">This shot looks so familier, the changing of the colors, I''m surrounded by it here too!  This is a lovely shot overall, the cropping is a bit off for my taste, the trees in the front are distracting a bit.  The lighting seems a bit dull but the overall effect of the shot is very good.  I''m starting this one with a 7</td>', 'This shot looks so familier, the changing of the colors, I''m surrounded by it here too!  This is a lovely shot overall, the cropping is a bit off for my taste, the trees in the front are distracting a bit.  The lighting seems a bit dull but the overall effect of the shot is very good.  I''m starting this one with a 7', '2003-10-16 18:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(452991, 41957, 12448, '<td valign="top">Upclose and personal it is.  Even a little dust to add some reality :)  The cliarity of the shot is wonderful and the cropping is very well done, though the left side of the head got cut off a little bit.  The reflections are very nice in the side of the head but the light on the very right is a bit bright.  I''m starting this one at a 6 but I will be back.</td>', 'Upclose and personal it is.  Even a little dust to add some reality :)  The cliarity of the shot is wonderful and the cropping is very well done, though the left side of the head got cut off a little bit.  The reflections are very nice in the side of the head but the light on the very right is a bit bright.  I''m starting this one at a 6 but I will be back.', '2003-10-16 18:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(452996, 41923, 12448, '<td valign="top">YES!  Now I''m hungry, between this and the food challenge I don''t stand a chance! :)<br/> <br/>This is a wonderful idea and having them on the leaf is a wonderful idea, a more natural setting as they say.  The colors, the clarity and the balance are wonderful!  The DOF also works well for this shot, I''m having a hard time finding fault with it so it must be a 10!</td>', 'YES!  Now I''m hungry, between this and the food challenge I don''t stand a chance! :) This is a wonderful idea and having them on the leaf is a wonderful idea, a more natural setting as they say.  The colors, the clarity and the balance are wonderful!  The DOF also works well for this shot, I''m having a hard time finding fault with it so it must be a 10!', '2003-10-16 18:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(453003, 42011, 12448, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, making the classic photographer mistake on purpose! ;)  The shot of the tree is wonderful, the colors are vibrant though the light seems a bit bright on the tree itself.  I''m starting this one at a 7 but I will be back.</td>', 'I like the idea, making the classic photographer mistake on purpose! ;)  The shot of the tree is wonderful, the colors are vibrant though the light seems a bit bright on the tree itself.  I''m starting this one at a 7 but I will be back.', '2003-10-16 18:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(453007, 42019, 10263, '<td valign="top">ahhh so thats what it looks like inside. Very creative. I like the colors</td>', 'ahhh so thats what it looks like inside. Very creative. I like the colors', '2003-10-16 18:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(453012, 42036, 12448, '<td valign="top">At first I couldn''t tell who was in the photograph until the letters in the upper left caught my eye.  I like the idea behind this shot but it really doesn''t convey the exposure of the conspiracy behing the killing of JFK.  As for the shot, the cropping is well done, the angle of the VHS tape to the book, the glasses sitting on the book.  The only think I''m not crazy about is the color chosen, it''s coming out a light sepia and I think B&amp;W would have worked better but that''s just me.  I''m starting this one at an 8</td>', 'At first I couldn''t tell who was in the photograph until the letters in the upper left caught my eye.  I like the idea behind this shot but it really doesn''t convey the exposure of the conspiracy behing the killing of JFK.  As for the shot, the cropping is well done, the angle of the VHS tape to the book, the glasses sitting on the book.  The only think I''m not crazy about is the color chosen, it''s coming out a light sepia and I think B&W would have worked better but that''s just me.  I''m starting this one at an 8', '2003-10-16 18:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(453013, 41576, 10263, '<td valign="top">Very good interpretation of challenge.</td>', 'Very good interpretation of challenge.', '2003-10-16 18:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(453016, 41962, 12448, '<td valign="top">Yummmmmmmmmmm!  I don''t stand a chance between this one and the food challenge!  Exposing the sweet center of one of my favorite treats, wonderful idea.  The reflections in the plate are very nice but the cropping leaves me just a tad off.  The dark circle around the bottom of the plate ends up being a bit distracting and if they were just slightly more centered.  The border also is a bit distracting, the small red one would have been enough, the addition of the black one takes away from the picture.  I"m starting this one at a 6</td>', 'Yummmmmmmmmmm!  I don''t stand a chance between this one and the food challenge!  Exposing the sweet center of one of my favorite treats, wonderful idea.  The reflections in the plate are very nice but the cropping leaves me just a tad off.  The dark circle around the bottom of the plate ends up being a bit distracting and if they were just slightly more centered.  The border also is a bit distracting, the small red one would have been enough, the addition of the black one takes away from the picture.  I"m starting this one at a 6', '2003-10-16 18:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(453022, 42023, 10263, '<td valign="top">LOL.. this is so funny. I love your sense of humor :) Of course it doesn''t really look like a page of a diary, because of the loose paper, but since you didn''t mean for it to be real, its wonderfully composed. Good job.</td>', 'LOL.. this is so funny. I love your sense of humor :) Of course it doesn''t really look like a page of a diary, because of the loose paper, but since you didn''t mean for it to be real, its wonderfully composed. Good job.', '2003-10-16 18:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(453024, 41922, 12448, '<td valign="top">Another one that I''ll be coming back to find out just how did you get that eff yoke and white in there without messing up the entire carton!  :)<br/> <br/>This is a wonderful shot, the lighting is perfect, the shadow falling across the egg, coming in from the top right is just the right brightness to look like sunshine coming through a window and making the egg yolk look like the sun.  The bubble in the white of the egg also adds to the shot.  Lucky or planned?  I''m really having a hard time finding any fault with this shot overall, a 10!</td>', 'Another one that I''ll be coming back to find out just how did you get that eff yoke and white in there without messing up the entire carton!  :) This is a wonderful shot, the lighting is perfect, the shadow falling across the egg, coming in from the top right is just the right brightness to look like sunshine coming through a window and making the egg yolk look like the sun.  The bubble in the white of the egg also adds to the shot.  Lucky or planned?  I''m really having a hard time finding any fault with this shot overall, a 10!', '2003-10-16 18:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(453026, 41950, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  The clarity on this shot is wonderful, though the overall size leaves me wanting more.  The cropping on this shot is also very good, the angle of the pod taking you from one side to the other and the DOF is well done.  I''m giving this one a 9</td>', 'Very cool.  The clarity on this shot is wonderful, though the overall size leaves me wanting more.  The cropping on this shot is also very good, the angle of the pod taking you from one side to the other and the DOF is well done.  I''m giving this one a 9', '2003-10-16 18:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(453028, 41608, 10263, '<td valign="top"><br/>Precious :) A bit dark though. I would like to see her face more clearly.</td>', 'Precious :) A bit dark though. I would like to see her face more clearly.', '2003-10-16 18:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(453030, 42015, 10263, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect. Nice composition. Wonderful colors</td>', 'Interesting effect. Nice composition. Wonderful colors', '2003-10-16 18:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(453032, 41858, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very inside!  The dew on this is wonderful and I have to wonder if it''s lettuce or a flower.  I''m thinking lettuce because of the edges and the stems coming up through the leaves.    The color on this is also a bit distracting overall, can''t quite explain why but it doesn''t quite appeal to me, it doesn''t jump out and grab my attention.  The lighting on this does seem to be very good and you get just a tad of reflection off the water.  I''m starting this one at a7</td>', 'Very inside!  The dew on this is wonderful and I have to wonder if it''s lettuce or a flower.  I''m thinking lettuce because of the edges and the stems coming up through the leaves.    The color on this is also a bit distracting overall, can''t quite explain why but it doesn''t quite appeal to me, it doesn''t jump out and grab my attention.  The lighting on this does seem to be very good and you get just a tad of reflection off the water.  I''m starting this one at a7', '2003-10-16 18:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(453038, 41739, 12448, '<td valign="top">So?  DID YOU WIN????? :)  Great idea, exposing the numbers.  The cropping is also well done, takes you from one side to the other and helps bring you into the shot.  The lighting seems just a bit dark to me and the background, with the speckles, though I''m thinking that is the dust from the ticket maybe, is a bit distracting.  I"m starting this one at a 7 but I will be back.</td>', 'So?  DID YOU WIN????? :)  Great idea, exposing the numbers.  The cropping is also well done, takes you from one side to the other and helps bring you into the shot.  The lighting seems just a bit dark to me and the background, with the speckles, though I''m thinking that is the dust from the ticket maybe, is a bit distracting.  I"m starting this one at a 7 but I will be back.', '2003-10-16 18:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(453040, 41964, 12448, '<td valign="top">My daughter''s favorite fruit!  She''s drooling over my shoulder! :)<br/> <br/>Lovely idea, great composition, cropping is well done but the shot seems just a bit bright, maybe a different background or softer lighting?  I''m starting this one at an 8</td>', 'My daughter''s favorite fruit!  She''s drooling over my shoulder! :) Lovely idea, great composition, cropping is well done but the shot seems just a bit bright, maybe a different background or softer lighting?  I''m starting this one at an 8', '2003-10-16 18:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(453046, 42015, 12448, '<td valign="top">The idea is good but the shot is over sharpened, too bright and the stones in the bottom distract from the roots.  I like the background, the way it reverses through the water in the vase and the lighting is good along with the cropping.  This one gets a 5 to start</td>', 'The idea is good but the shot is over sharpened, too bright and the stones in the bottom distract from the roots.  I like the background, the way it reverses through the water in the vase and the lighting is good along with the cropping.  This one gets a 5 to start', '2003-10-16 18:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(453049, 42004, 10263, '<td valign="top">hmm.. I''m assuming you mean the cats are in the pumpkins. Though the concept is cute, the picture isn''t appealing to me. It does fit the challenge though.</td>', 'hmm.. I''m assuming you mean the cats are in the pumpkins. Though the concept is cute, the picture isn''t appealing to me. It does fit the challenge though.', '2003-10-16 18:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(453050, 41148, 12448, '<td valign="top">Hum, now I am hungry again!  Darn it!  This is a lovely shot over all, the way the carmel is coming out of the chocolate is wonderful and the clarity of the shot is amazing.  I would have gone with just the one flower opened with the bud behind it and left the two on the left out of the shot, they tend to be a bit distracting to me.  This one gets a 9</td>', 'Hum, now I am hungry again!  Darn it!  This is a lovely shot over all, the way the carmel is coming out of the chocolate is wonderful and the clarity of the shot is amazing.  I would have gone with just the one flower opened with the bud behind it and left the two on the left out of the shot, they tend to be a bit distracting to me.  This one gets a 9', '2003-10-16 18:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(453052, 42037, 10263, '<td valign="top">I like cat shots that are done artistically. This one just looks like a snap shot though. If the cat was looking out, and with a closer crop it might be more interesting.</td>', 'I like cat shots that are done artistically. This one just looks like a snap shot though. If the cat was looking out, and with a closer crop it might be more interesting.', '2003-10-16 18:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(453054, 41608, 12448, '<td valign="top">Boo to you too!  A wonderful take on the challenge and the shot was probably a lot of fun to do!  The only thing that would have made this better is if the little one had a look of "GOTCHA" on her face.  The motion of the hair and blanket really add to the shot while you managed to keep her face in good focus.  There seems to be a bit of noise on her face but the lighting is well done also.  This one starts at a 7 for me.</td>', 'Boo to you too!  A wonderful take on the challenge and the shot was probably a lot of fun to do!  The only thing that would have made this better is if the little one had a look of "GOTCHA" on her face.  The motion of the hair and blanket really add to the shot while you managed to keep her face in good focus.  There seems to be a bit of noise on her face but the lighting is well done also.  This one starts at a 7 for me.', '2003-10-16 18:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(453058, 42042, 10263, '<td valign="top">Good concept and tones.</td>', 'Good concept and tones.', '2003-10-16 18:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(453060, 42017, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot to me.  The shadows, the subject, the lighting are perfect.  The lines in the shot draw you across the shot from each side and top to bottom.  Yet another 10 on this one.  Well done.</td>', 'This is a wonderful shot to me.  The shadows, the subject, the lighting are perfect.  The lines in the shot draw you across the shot from each side and top to bottom.  Yet another 10 on this one.  Well done.', '2003-10-16 18:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(453065, 41312, 12448, '<td valign="top">How cute!  You almost have to wonder how many people see that little face on there!  The take on this challenge was well met in this shot to me.  But as for the shot, I think coming down on the level of hydrant is a drawback of sorts, if you were a little higher and had the face peeking out from above to show the concealment, don''t know if that was really possible.   I''m starting this one at a 7 but I will be back</td>', 'How cute!  You almost have to wonder how many people see that little face on there!  The take on this challenge was well met in this shot to me.  But as for the shot, I think coming down on the level of hydrant is a drawback of sorts, if you were a little higher and had the face peeking out from above to show the concealment, don''t know if that was really possible.   I''m starting this one at a 7 but I will be back', '2003-10-16 18:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(453066, 42017, 11283, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast</td>', 'Nice contrast', '2003-10-16 18:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(453071, 41084, 12448, '<td valign="top">Now how did that one get by the inspector at the Hersey plant?  :)  A wonderful idea on the challenge and the set up is great, almost as if they are on a line coming out.  The lighting seems a bit dark and the shot slightly out of focus on the main subject, that sweet little kiss that is making me crave chocolate, thanks! ;)<br/> <br/>I''m giving this one a 6 but I will be back.</td>', 'Now how did that one get by the inspector at the Hersey plant?  :)  A wonderful idea on the challenge and the set up is great, almost as if they are on a line coming out.  The lighting seems a bit dark and the shot slightly out of focus on the main subject, that sweet little kiss that is making me crave chocolate, thanks! ;) I''m giving this one a 6 but I will be back.', '2003-10-16 18:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(453072, 41271, 11283, '<td valign="top">Nice. Would make a great cover for Nat Geo.</td>', 'Nice. Would make a great cover for Nat Geo.', '2003-10-16 18:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(453077, 41993, 12448, '<td valign="top">Ooooooooo poor puppy!!  I almost did something very similar to this because my daughter had brought her bear pillow to me to be fixed!<br/> <br/>I like the idea, the shot itself though leaves me a bit of center.  The angle you are coming at is slightly disorienting to me, if the dog had been shot from above while he was on his back or even on the side.  This just looks like a very unnatural way to find him.  Also the cropping is off to me, I would have liked to see the whole dog.  This gets a 7 to start</td>', 'Ooooooooo poor puppy!!  I almost did something very similar to this because my daughter had brought her bear pillow to me to be fixed! I like the idea, the shot itself though leaves me a bit of center.  The angle you are coming at is slightly disorienting to me, if the dog had been shot from above while he was on his back or even on the side.  This just looks like a very unnatural way to find him.  Also the cropping is off to me, I would have liked to see the whole dog.  This gets a 7 to start', '2003-10-16 19:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(453078, 42002, 10263, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot. Even the cat haters can''t fault this photo :) My pick for the blue ribbon so far.</td>', 'Gorgeous shot. Even the cat haters can''t fault this photo :) My pick for the blue ribbon so far.', '2003-10-16 19:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(453081, 41440, 11283, '<td valign="top">Pretty good...but cropped too tight at the bottom.</td>', 'Pretty good...but cropped too tight at the bottom.', '2003-10-16 19:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(453085, 41542, 12448, '<td valign="top">Geode!  Seen enough of these for sure in my lifetime!  The idea is great.  The shot itself though, while the cropping is great the lighting on the right is too bright and the shadow that falls across the center is distracting.  Knowing how beautiful these can be inside with the right lighting I would have played with it from that side and had more of the focus on the center.  Starting this one at a 5</td>', 'Geode!  Seen enough of these for sure in my lifetime!  The idea is great.  The shot itself though, while the cropping is great the lighting on the right is too bright and the shadow that falls across the center is distracting.  Knowing how beautiful these can be inside with the right lighting I would have played with it from that side and had more of the focus on the center.  Starting this one at a 5', '2003-10-16 19:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(453087, 41988, 10263, '<td valign="top">This definately fits the challenge. I think it could have been better on a different background. And maybe clean up the crumbs around the area. Probably a closer shot or a closer crop would have made a better shot too.</td>', 'This definately fits the challenge. I think it could have been better on a different background. And maybe clean up the crumbs around the area. Probably a closer shot or a closer crop would have made a better shot too.', '2003-10-16 19:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(453090, 41411, 12448, '<td valign="top">Wow, how cool!  Is this for real?  If so, you are so lucky to be taht close to it!  If not, it sure looks real!  This is a great take on the challenge, something that''s been concealed for so long now exposed back to the harsh light and reality of our world.  Speaking of light, I''m guessing it was a cloudy day when this was taken, it seems rather muted.  The sharpness is there without being too much and the colors are a bit dull but considering what you are working with it''s expected.  Starting this with an 8</td>', 'Wow, how cool!  Is this for real?  If so, you are so lucky to be taht close to it!  If not, it sure looks real!  This is a great take on the challenge, something that''s been concealed for so long now exposed back to the harsh light and reality of our world.  Speaking of light, I''m guessing it was a cloudy day when this was taken, it seems rather muted.  The sharpness is there without being too much and the colors are a bit dull but considering what you are working with it''s expected.  Starting this with an 8', '2003-10-16 19:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(453097, 41533, 12448, '<td valign="top">How pretty!  What kind of flower is that?  Having the two of them side by side with a coupld of pods is very well thought out but the balance seems off a bit.  Almost like you could cut the shot in half and you probably could have and still gotten your point across with the partially opened one and pod on the right.  The colors are wonderful but the light seems just a tad harsh.  Starting this one with a 7</td>', 'How pretty!  What kind of flower is that?  Having the two of them side by side with a coupld of pods is very well thought out but the balance seems off a bit.  Almost like you could cut the shot in half and you probably could have and still gotten your point across with the partially opened one and pod on the right.  The colors are wonderful but the light seems just a tad harsh.  Starting this one with a 7', '2003-10-16 19:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(453098, 41960, 10263, '<td valign="top">I was going to do a banana but it got eaten. Glad I didn''t now because it could not have compared to this one. BEAUTIFUL. Excellent DoF</td>', 'I was going to do a banana but it got eaten. Glad I didn''t now because it could not have compared to this one. BEAUTIFUL. Excellent DoF', '2003-10-16 19:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(453099, 41859, 12448, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure if I get the connection to the challenge on this one, I''m thinking she''s being exposed in the window in hopes of finding a new mommy to take her home?  If so, very original!  If not, could you please let me know?  <br/> <br/>As for the shot, nice cropping, the lighting is good and the colors are very nice.  The dull, washed out paint on the sill compaired to the brightness of the canister in the window.  I''m starting this one at an 8</td>', 'I''m not quite sure if I get the connection to the challenge on this one, I''m thinking she''s being exposed in the window in hopes of finding a new mommy to take her home?  If so, very original!  If not, could you please let me know?   As for the shot, nice cropping, the lighting is good and the colors are very nice.  The dull, washed out paint on the sill compaired to the brightness of the canister in the window.  I''m starting this one at an 8', '2003-10-16 19:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(453111, 41849, 10263, '<td valign="top">Very creative and well done. Wonderful interpretation of challenge</td>', 'Very creative and well done. Wonderful interpretation of challenge', '2003-10-16 19:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(453120, 41747, 63, '<td valign="top">Wow!  My Submariner has a black face, always wondered what was under it.  Are you a rolex mechanic?  I have a son-n-law who is.  He keeps mine purring.<br/>Photo is a great product shot, would give an 8 if I could vote.</td>', 'Wow!  My Submariner has a black face, always wondered what was under it.  Are you a rolex mechanic?  I have a son-n-law who is.  He keeps mine purring.Photo is a great product shot, would give an 8 if I could vote.', '2003-10-16 19:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(453131, 41968, 11570, '<td valign="top">An original bug in the machine and an original "take" on the challenge!<br/> <br/>The very tight DOF does not do the composition justice.  If the moths wings were in sharper focus you could ahve probably dispensed with the tweezers.</td>', 'An original bug in the machine and an original "take" on the challenge! The very tight DOF does not do the composition justice.  If the moths wings were in sharper focus you could ahve probably dispensed with the tweezers.', '2003-10-16 19:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
