(453326, 41970, 7711, '<td valign="top">very beautiful skin, but the disembodied bottom disturbs me somehow. I wish i could see a whole person here, even if the main focal point is the bum. lighting is nice however! :)</td>', 'very beautiful skin, but the disembodied bottom disturbs me somehow. I wish i could see a whole person here, even if the main focal point is the bum. lighting is nice however! :)', '2003-10-16 23:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(453328, 41948, 12448, '<td valign="top">I love this concept that you were going for, the sun being exposed through the trees but to be honest the filter you used to create the prism effect really hurt the shot to me.   While the colors are very pretty it washes out the rest of the shot to me and make the center of attention, the sun a distraction instead of an attraction.  I''m starting this one at a 4 but I will be back to study it more.</td>', 'I love this concept that you were going for, the sun being exposed through the trees but to be honest the filter you used to create the prism effect really hurt the shot to me.   While the colors are very pretty it washes out the rest of the shot to me and make the center of attention, the sun a distraction instead of an attraction.  I''m starting this one at a 4 but I will be back to study it more.', '2003-10-16 23:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(453330, 41582, 12448, '<td valign="top">Why yes it is!  A good take on the challenge for me and the overall shot is nice but the object of your desire, the moon is lost in the space.  If you could have come in more on the center of the shot and been able to capture it just as it was coming up over the horizon.  This one gets a 4 to start</td>', 'Why yes it is!  A good take on the challenge for me and the overall shot is nice but the object of your desire, the moon is lost in the space.  If you could have come in more on the center of the shot and been able to capture it just as it was coming up over the horizon.  This one gets a 4 to start', '2003-10-16 23:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(453333, 41067, 12448, '<td valign="top">What a perfect leaf!  And the cropping is well done except and this is nitpicky, the lower left point of the leaf looks like it got cut off.  I know, I know, I''m sorry but the line on the leaf keeps drawing me there and with the others cropped so perfectly it just kinda jumps at me.  I love the stark background really brings out the color of the leaf.  I''m starting this at an 8 and I''ll be back to see if that little point still gets to me or not.<br/> <br/>Okay, I''m back and now that I look again, it''s not really cut off at all, it''s cropped really, really close! :)  Raising this to a 10!</td>', 'What a perfect leaf!  And the cropping is well done except and this is nitpicky, the lower left point of the leaf looks like it got cut off.  I know, I know, I''m sorry but the line on the leaf keeps drawing me there and with the others cropped so perfectly it just kinda jumps at me.  I love the stark background really brings out the color of the leaf.  I''m starting this at an 8 and I''ll be back to see if that little point still gets to me or not. Okay, I''m back and now that I look again, it''s not really cut off at all, it''s cropped really, really close! :)  Raising this to a 10!', '2003-10-16 23:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(453335, 42033, 12448, '<td valign="top">EEEEEEKKKKKKK!!!!!!  LOL!  What did you spray them with to quiet them down?  I\''m know they usually use smoke to settle them down and the white across the bottom is making it a bit too fuzzy.  More contrast and a bit more clarity would score this much higher.  I\''m starting with a 4, will be back to look again before the end of the challenge.  <br/> <br/>I''m back and looking again at the ones I started lower and looking at this again, I like the smoke effect, it almost looks like ice!  Raising you to a 6 for now.</td>', 'EEEEEEKKKKKKK!!!!!!  LOL!  What did you spray them with to quiet them down?  I\''m know they usually use smoke to settle them down and the white across the bottom is making it a bit too fuzzy.  More contrast and a bit more clarity would score this much higher.  I\''m starting with a 4, will be back to look again before the end of the challenge.   I''m back and looking again at the ones I started lower and looking at this again, I like the smoke effect, it almost looks like ice!  Raising you to a 6 for now.', '2003-10-16 23:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
