(453338, 41838, 12448, '<td valign="top">A wonderful idea, I had a secret love in high school who I never did revel myself to.  The shot is a bit dark for my taste and if the note was shown where an actual name was on the bottom would complete the concept.  A bit more light would score this one much higher for me.  Starting with a 5, I''ll check it again.<br/> <br/>I''m back, the darkness still bothers me a but but the overall composition of the shot and the candles make up for that.  Maybe if the cropp had come down a bit from the top.  Going from a 5 to an 8</td>', 'A wonderful idea, I had a secret love in high school who I never did revel myself to.  The shot is a bit dark for my taste and if the note was shown where an actual name was on the bottom would complete the concept.  A bit more light would score this one much higher for me.  Starting with a 5, I''ll check it again. I''m back, the darkness still bothers me a but but the overall composition of the shot and the candles make up for that.  Maybe if the cropp had come down a bit from the top.  Going from a 5 to an 8', '2003-10-16 23:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(453340, 41968, 12448, '<td valign="top">Oh, poor moth!!!!  I love this concept, I hope you didn''t kill that poor moth just for this shot! :)  If the entire shot was in focus I would score much higher to start on this shot, the fuzzy needlenose pliers is a bit too distracting for me.  Starting with a 6, I''ll be back.</td>', 'Oh, poor moth!!!!  I love this concept, I hope you didn''t kill that poor moth just for this shot! :)  If the entire shot was in focus I would score much higher to start on this shot, the fuzzy needlenose pliers is a bit too distracting for me.  Starting with a 6, I''ll be back.', '2003-10-16 23:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(453341, 42002, 12448, '<td valign="top">Here Kitty, Kitty, KITTY! :)  What a beautiful face, the eye color is so wonderful, the sharpness of the shot, the look on the cat''s face is perfect.  The only distraction is the grass across the nose, like a little green moustache!  Starting with a 9, can only go higher if I come back and check it again!</td>', 'Here Kitty, Kitty, KITTY! :)  What a beautiful face, the eye color is so wonderful, the sharpness of the shot, the look on the cat''s face is perfect.  The only distraction is the grass across the nose, like a little green moustache!  Starting with a 9, can only go higher if I come back and check it again!', '2003-10-16 23:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(453343, 41714, 12448, '<td valign="top">A very clear, crisp shot.  The lighting coming in from one side really adds to the shot but the total darkness on the other side is just a tad distracting and it looks fuzzy next to the top.  Starting with an 8, may go higher.<br/> <br/>I''m back and looking again, the darkness on the left really does add to the shot more than distract from it upon a second look, bumping you up to a 9</td>', 'A very clear, crisp shot.  The lighting coming in from one side really adds to the shot but the total darkness on the other side is just a tad distracting and it looks fuzzy next to the top.  Starting with an 8, may go higher. I''m back and looking again, the darkness on the left really does add to the shot more than distract from it upon a second look, bumping you up to a 9', '2003-10-16 23:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(453344, 41123, 11073, '<td valign="top">ouch - hope that''s not yours.  I''m so glad that that experience is well behind me!  Kudos for originality, good take on the category.  My only suggestion would be to up the contrast to "bring out" the xray a little more.  Right now, the pen kind of blends in a little, maybe using a different color would serve to emphasize better.  Just a thought.  Nice work.</td>', 'ouch - hope that''s not yours.  I''m so glad that that experience is well behind me!  Kudos for originality, good take on the category.  My only suggestion would be to up the contrast to "bring out" the xray a little more.  Right now, the pen kind of blends in a little, maybe using a different color would serve to emphasize better.  Just a thought.  Nice work.', '2003-10-16 23:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(453352, 41900, 11073, '<td valign="top">Good take on the category.  My only suggestion would be to use another angle to cut out the other houses in the neighborhood, they are a little distracting.  Just a thought, nice idea.</td>', 'Good take on the category.  My only suggestion would be to use another angle to cut out the other houses in the neighborhood, they are a little distracting.  Just a thought, nice idea.', '2003-10-16 23:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
