(453371, 41172, 12448, '<td valign="top">I understand what you are going for here and the concept is good but the shot itself leaves me a bit dizzy.  The way the words go in and out of focus and I know that is on purpose to highlight the words you have focused but the effect makes my eyes hurt a bit.  And I could be the only one that it does that to.  Also if the front of the key was more focused with the word this would really have a more profound effect to me.  I''m starting this one at a 7</td>', 'I understand what you are going for here and the concept is good but the shot itself leaves me a bit dizzy.  The way the words go in and out of focus and I know that is on purpose to highlight the words you have focused but the effect makes my eyes hurt a bit.  And I could be the only one that it does that to.  Also if the front of the key was more focused with the word this would really have a more profound effect to me.  I''m starting this one at a 7', '2003-10-16 23:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
