(453778, 41730, 11570, '<td valign="top">A delightful capture of a child at play.<br/> <br/>Yes, baby teeth certainly concealed and revealed.<br/> <br/>Image wise - B&amp;W does give this a certain something but the softness makes the effect lose impact.  With the tight DOF I appreciate that the hand and pole would be OOF but the face IMO needs to be sharp and crisp.</td>', 'A delightful capture of a child at play. Yes, baby teeth certainly concealed and revealed. Image wise - B&W does give this a certain something but the softness makes the effect lose impact.  With the tight DOF I appreciate that the hand and pole would be OOF but the face IMO needs to be sharp and crisp.', '2003-10-17 11:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(453782, 41818, 11738, '<td valign="top">LOL!  I saw the title come up before the image and was expecting to see some scantily clad temptress.  AWESOME idea and EXCELLENT play on words.  One of my favourites for this challenge.</td>', 'LOL!  I saw the title come up before the image and was expecting to see some scantily clad temptress.  AWESOME idea and EXCELLENT play on words.  One of my favourites for this challenge.', '2003-10-17 11:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
