(453951, 41791, 12598, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp, styleistic shot.</td>', 'Nice sharp, styleistic shot.', '2003-10-17 16:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(453952, 41714, 12598, '<td valign="top">Good comp and sharpness. If this bulb is burned out, it should look more so. Having the nice bright white light on a burned out bulb would emote more, IMHO.</td>', 'Good comp and sharpness. If this bulb is burned out, it should look more so. Having the nice bright white light on a burned out bulb would emote more, IMHO.', '2003-10-17 16:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(453953, 41762, 12598, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, could use work on the composition to try to emote something or tell a story.</td>', 'Interesting subject, could use work on the composition to try to emote something or tell a story.', '2003-10-17 16:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(453958, 41172, 12598, '<td valign="top">Excellent emotive lighting, great compositon. The key made it!</td>', 'Excellent emotive lighting, great compositon. The key made it!', '2003-10-17 16:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(453961, 41576, 12598, '<td valign="top">A little too much emphasis on the bland camera body. The lens is placed as if the camera has been thrown down on the ground. If that is intentional I think we need a bit more info in the shot to tell more of the story. Good overall.</td>', 'A little too much emphasis on the bland camera body. The lens is placed as if the camera has been thrown down on the ground. If that is intentional I think we need a bit more info in the shot to tell more of the story. Good overall.', '2003-10-17 16:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(453964, 41772, 12598, '<td valign="top">Good product shot. Emotes the value of the film. Implies that the film will be high quality with bright colours.</td>', 'Good product shot. Emotes the value of the film. Implies that the film will be high quality with bright colours.', '2003-10-17 16:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(453976, 41838, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but I think it''s too tightly framed and could use more detail in the upper part of the picture. Again, I like the composition!</td>', 'Nice composition but I think it''s too tightly framed and could use more detail in the upper part of the picture. Again, I like the composition!', '2003-10-17 16:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(453977, 41148, 6100, '<td valign="top">Well exposed. It''s often hard to get the full tonality of whites but you''ve done a good job here. That chocolate looks yummy!</td>', 'Well exposed. It''s often hard to get the full tonality of whites but you''ve done a good job here. That chocolate looks yummy!', '2003-10-17 16:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(453978, 41962, 6100, '<td valign="top">Certainly "exposed". In my opinion, the highlights on the wrappers should be broader (use something to diffuse the lights). I like the curve of the plate and, although I might have placed it a little differently, it adds interest to your composition.</td>', 'Certainly "exposed". In my opinion, the highlights on the wrappers should be broader (use something to diffuse the lights). I like the curve of the plate and, although I might have placed it a little differently, it adds interest to your composition.', '2003-10-17 16:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(453979, 41474, 6100, '<td valign="top">Whoops! I hope this wasn''t a working phone (or that you know how to put it back together!) Focus seems a little soft around the circuit board area but good composition.</td>', 'Whoops! I hope this wasn''t a working phone (or that you know how to put it back together!) Focus seems a little soft around the circuit board area but good composition.', '2003-10-17 16:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(453980, 41411, 6100, '<td valign="top">Excellent choice for "Exposed"! Besides the bones, the lines around them add interest to the picture. Well exposed, too.</td>', 'Excellent choice for "Exposed"! Besides the bones, the lines around them add interest to the picture. Well exposed, too.', '2003-10-17 16:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(453983, 42023, 6100, '<td valign="top">It''s not nice to snoop in other peoples diaries ... but I''m going to believe that this is a made-up entry. This definately qualifies as "Exposed"!</td>', 'It''s not nice to snoop in other peoples diaries ... but I''m going to believe that this is a made-up entry. This definately qualifies as "Exposed"!', '2003-10-17 16:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(453984, 42029, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nice focusing job and what an interesting and beautiful subject!</td>', 'Nice focusing job and what an interesting and beautiful subject!', '2003-10-17 16:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(453987, 41849, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the soft focus. It makes the hands add to the composition rather than being so distinct that they distract. The light coming from the chest is certainly the main point of interest and your title then adds to that.</td>', 'Nice job with the soft focus. It makes the hands add to the composition rather than being so distinct that they distract. The light coming from the chest is certainly the main point of interest and your title then adds to that.', '2003-10-17 16:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(453990, 41994, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the desaturation. Certainly leaves no doubt where the eye goes to. Nice composition, too.</td>', 'Nice job with the desaturation. Certainly leaves no doubt where the eye goes to. Nice composition, too.', '2003-10-17 17:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(453992, 41041, 6100, '<td valign="top">Isn''t nature wonderful!!! Nice exposure and I like the colors.</td>', 'Isn''t nature wonderful!!! Nice exposure and I like the colors.', '2003-10-17 17:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(453993, 41950, 6100, '<td valign="top">I would like to see this a little larger ... maybe it''s my "old" eyes ... but I''d like to be able to see the detail a little better. Nice composition.</td>', 'I would like to see this a little larger ... maybe it''s my "old" eyes ... but I''d like to be able to see the detail a little better. Nice composition.', '2003-10-17 17:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(453994, 41858, 6100, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color.</td>', 'Beautiful color.', '2003-10-17 17:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(453995, 41968, 6100, '<td valign="top">Yea ... that''s certainly how the term came into being. I think the focus could be a little sharper. That would really help this picture to "pop".</td>', 'Yea ... that''s certainly how the term came into being. I think the focus could be a little sharper. That would really help this picture to "pop".', '2003-10-17 17:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(453999, 42019, 6100, '<td valign="top">This would make a good advertising image. Very well done. I like the overall blue tone, the lack of significant detail around the edges, and I like the concept you''ve chosen for "exposed".</td>', 'This would make a good advertising image. Very well done. I like the overall blue tone, the lack of significant detail around the edges, and I like the concept you''ve chosen for "exposed".', '2003-10-17 17:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(454000, 41952, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Yellow and blue are a terrific combination. I''m not sure that the "rust" color adds too much to the color contrast you''ve established. The concept is super but I would tone down the hand a slight amount. Nice use of the diagonal leading line.</td>', 'Nice image. Yellow and blue are a terrific combination. I''m not sure that the "rust" color adds too much to the color contrast you''ve established. The concept is super but I would tone down the hand a slight amount. Nice use of the diagonal leading line.', '2003-10-17 17:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(454016, 42027, 6100, '<td valign="top">I like the muted colors here and the angle of the light hitting the stone.</td>', 'I like the muted colors here and the angle of the light hitting the stone.', '2003-10-17 17:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(454025, 41874, 8860, '<td valign="top">If this is stuffed I''ll wish I''d given it a much lower score, but I''ll assume this was an excellent capture instead! Despite the slight blurring this is a rare study of an urban scabenger caught nicely, with atmosphere, in the act. [8]</td>', 'If this is stuffed I''ll wish I''d given it a much lower score, but I''ll assume this was an excellent capture instead! Despite the slight blurring this is a rare study of an urban scabenger caught nicely, with atmosphere, in the act. [8]', '2003-10-17 17:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(454088, 41970, 13274, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, love the skin tones</td>', 'Beautiful, love the skin tones', '2003-10-17 18:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(454136, 41441, 8860, '<td valign="top">Just stunning display. I like the take on the challenge - and I bet this pic (great though it is) doesn''t do the scene justice. [8]</td>', 'Just stunning display. I like the take on the challenge - and I bet this pic (great though it is) doesn''t do the scene justice. [8]', '2003-10-17 19:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(454151, 42008, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very neat idea. Funny stuff - quite South Park that puke I think! Lighting is a little flat, so less ambient light and a strong directional light source would help.</td>', 'Very neat idea. Funny stuff - quite South Park that puke I think! Lighting is a little flat, so less ambient light and a strong directional light source would help.', '2003-10-17 19:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(454155, 42042, 8860, '<td valign="top">Smooth shot and nice glimpse of the disc brakes (Brembo?).</td>', 'Smooth shot and nice glimpse of the disc brakes (Brembo?).', '2003-10-17 19:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(454182, 41041, 12733, '<td valign="top">Timing is everything. Well, also exposure, shallow depth of field, lighting and focus. Great shot.</td>', 'Timing is everything. Well, also exposure, shallow depth of field, lighting and focus. Great shot.', '2003-10-17 20:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(454184, 41148, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty shot, but the dual subject is a bit confusing. I think the flower and buds could have stood well on their own - though you''d lose your pun.</td>', 'This is a pretty shot, but the dual subject is a bit confusing. I think the flower and buds could have stood well on their own - though you''d lose your pun.', '2003-10-17 20:30:37.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(454185, 41312, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very cute shot. Did you also paint the face, or was it there to start with?</td>', 'Very cute shot. Did you also paint the face, or was it there to start with?', '2003-10-17 20:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(454186, 42016, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very pretty lighting and composition. This is a nice fall shot.</td>', 'Very pretty lighting and composition. This is a nice fall shot.', '2003-10-17 20:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(454187, 42009, 12733, '<td valign="top">It may not be fair, but after looking at about half a dozen shots of CD ROM drives, hard drives or other internal computer parts it isn''t possible to look at one without recalling the ones that had unusual lighting, reflections off metal and other standout features. This is a nice shot, but it''s entered in a tough field.</td>', 'It may not be fair, but after looking at about half a dozen shots of CD ROM drives, hard drives or other internal computer parts it isn''t possible to look at one without recalling the ones that had unusual lighting, reflections off metal and other standout features. This is a nice shot, but it''s entered in a tough field.', '2003-10-17 20:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(454189, 41818, 12733, '<td valign="top">I thought I could recognize any sort of fruits or nuts, but this one has me baffled! What is it? You''ve captured the textures well, and picked your background to enhance the main subject.</td>', 'I thought I could recognize any sort of fruits or nuts, but this one has me baffled! What is it? You''ve captured the textures well, and picked your background to enhance the main subject.', '2003-10-17 20:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(454193, 41970, 8860, '<td valign="top">What a delightful peach! I was getting worried for a moment that no one was going to submit a ''skin'' shot, so well done! Very nicely lit with good tones and a nice angle.<br/> <br/>Personally, I don''t think this subject should be re-covered!  ;)</td>', 'What a delightful peach! I was getting worried for a moment that no one was going to submit a ''skin'' shot, so well done! Very nicely lit with good tones and a nice angle. Personally, I don''t think this subject should be re-covered!  ;)', '2003-10-17 20:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(454194, 41952, 12733, '<td valign="top">Almost an abstract, and the illusion of removing paint with the roller is very effective. Imho the hand detracts from the abstract quality - leaving it out (perhaps by cropping part of the roller handle) would make a more effective shot.</td>', 'Almost an abstract, and the illusion of removing paint with the roller is very effective. Imho the hand detracts from the abstract quality - leaving it out (perhaps by cropping part of the roller handle) would make a more effective shot.', '2003-10-17 20:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(454197, 41608, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very cute shot. A bit more contrast in the child''s face would make it perfect, and I don''t think the extra contrast would harm the rest of the photo.</td>', 'Very cute shot. A bit more contrast in the child''s face would make it perfect, and I don''t think the extra contrast would harm the rest of the photo.', '2003-10-17 20:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(454198, 41618, 8860, '<td valign="top">This poor guy looks like he really has bared his soul. This is a beautiful study of a desperate subject. Wonderful tones, lighting and positioning - a brave shot and an unhesitant [10]</td>', 'This poor guy looks like he really has bared his soul. This is a beautiful study of a desperate subject. Wonderful tones, lighting and positioning - a brave shot and an unhesitant [10]', '2003-10-17 20:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(454199, 42015, 12733, '<td valign="top">I really like the potpourri of colors and shapes, along with the transuscent effect. Beautiful use of light and reflection.</td>', 'I really like the potpourri of colors and shapes, along with the transuscent effect. Beautiful use of light and reflection.', '2003-10-17 20:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(454386, 41901, 13285, '<td valign="top">i think this may have been better with the third object out or another object in the sequence between the third and fourth.<br/> <br/>-drew</td>', 'i think this may have been better with the third object out or another object in the sequence between the third and fourth. -drew', '2003-10-18 01:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(454424, 41948, 1280, '<td valign="top">Wild! Honestly I''m not sure what to think of it.  Sort of pyschedelic!  Certainly interesting.</td>', 'Wild! Honestly I''m not sure what to think of it.  Sort of pyschedelic!  Certainly interesting.', '2003-10-18 02:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(454426, 41608, 1280, '<td valign="top">Cute!  Nice colouring. A wee bit dark, but acceptable.  I like it.</td>', 'Cute!  Nice colouring. A wee bit dark, but acceptable.  I like it.', '2003-10-18 02:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(454427, 41962, 1280, '<td valign="top">Omigosh!  Luscious!!!  The only thing I''d prefer is...lol...DARK chocolate.</td>', 'Omigosh!  Luscious!!!  The only thing I''d prefer is...lol...DARK chocolate.', '2003-10-18 02:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(454429, 41576, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice. I think I would have left out the lens.  Jus the cam and film would be enough.  Still a good one.</td>', 'Nice. I think I would have left out the lens.  Jus the cam and film would be enough.  Still a good one.', '2003-10-18 02:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(454430, 41589, 1280, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Good texture and meets the challenge.  The yellow tinge detracts though.</td>', 'Great idea.  Good texture and meets the challenge.  The yellow tinge detracts though.', '2003-10-18 02:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(454431, 42026, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good solid image.</td>', 'Good solid image.', '2003-10-18 02:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(454434, 41842, 1280, '<td valign="top">It''s a wonderful image.  The colours are fantastic.  I don''t really see the challenge here though.  I''d score higher in a different challenge.  Nice work though.  I hope she was checked for ticks after her foray thru the flowers.</td>', 'It''s a wonderful image.  The colours are fantastic.  I don''t really see the challenge here though.  I''d score higher in a different challenge.  Nice work though.  I hope she was checked for ticks after her foray thru the flowers.', '2003-10-18 02:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(454440, 41923, 9441, '<td valign="top">wonderful macro...nice composition</td>', 'wonderful macro...nice composition', '2003-10-18 03:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(454441, 42041, 9441, '<td valign="top">nice closeup showing a lot of intricate detail...good job!</td>', 'nice closeup showing a lot of intricate detail...good job!', '2003-10-18 03:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(454442, 41533, 9441, '<td valign="top">what an interesting and intriguing flower...I love the texture and colors!  Nice composition and cropping.</td>', 'what an interesting and intriguing flower...I love the texture and colors!  Nice composition and cropping.', '2003-10-18 03:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(454494, 42008, 12076, '<td valign="top">Kind of silly...  but well done!  Made me lauph this morning!   :-D</td>', 'Kind of silly...  but well done!  Made me lauph this morning!   :-D', '2003-10-18 07:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(454712, 41271, 6870, '<td valign="top">Now there''s a cut face! Nice macro. Clarity and lighting are very nice.</td>', 'Now there''s a cut face! Nice macro. Clarity and lighting are very nice.', '2003-10-18 16:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(454714, 42030, 6870, '<td valign="top">Perfect composition and great expression on her face. Ample negative space to imply the cold world. Tones and colors are just marvelous!</td>', 'Perfect composition and great expression on her face. Ample negative space to imply the cold world. Tones and colors are just marvelous!', '2003-10-18 16:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(454716, 41377, 6870, '<td valign="top">Tight crop brings attention to this former flower. I''d like the photo to slide over to the right by about half an inch so we could get a look at the feathery seeds that are being exposed. Tones are pewterish and lovely! Nice exposure, too!</td>', 'Tight crop brings attention to this former flower. I''d like the photo to slide over to the right by about half an inch so we could get a look at the feathery seeds that are being exposed. Tones are pewterish and lovely! Nice exposure, too!', '2003-10-18 16:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(454765, 41748, 8125, '<td valign="top">Very nicely shot - I like the colors - one of my favorites of the hard drive entries.</td>', 'Very nicely shot - I like the colors - one of my favorites of the hard drive entries.', '2003-10-18 19:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(454766, 41842, 8125, '<td valign="top">The colors in the shot are very pretty.  I don''t see how this fits into the challenge... 5</td>', 'The colors in the shot are very pretty.  I don''t see how this fits into the challenge... 5', '2003-10-18 19:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(454767, 41271, 8125, '<td valign="top">Nice of this guy to come out for a photo opp  :-)  Great focus on his eyes... nicely bordered.</td>', 'Nice of this guy to come out for a photo opp  :-)  Great focus on his eyes... nicely bordered.', '2003-10-18 19:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(454770, 42033, 8125, '<td valign="top">Inside a honeycomb.. nice idea for the challenge.  It looks like most of the bees are dead, they are upside down.  The image seems a bit grainy, otherwise - well shot!</td>', 'Inside a honeycomb.. nice idea for the challenge.  It looks like most of the bees are dead, they are upside down.  The image seems a bit grainy, otherwise - well shot!', '2003-10-18 19:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(454771, 41974, 8125, '<td valign="top">You had to really be looking for this guy.  The only thing that couldv''e made it better is had you been able to pull down that leaf in the lower left corner.  My attention is drawn to that... otherwise, clearly focused on the snail.  Nice work.</td>', 'You had to really be looking for this guy.  The only thing that couldv''e made it better is had you been able to pull down that leaf in the lower left corner.  My attention is drawn to that... otherwise, clearly focused on the snail.  Nice work.', '2003-10-18 20:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(454772, 42039, 8125, '<td valign="top">A cool keypad on that phone!  Nicely shot - I like your composition and lighting.</td>', 'A cool keypad on that phone!  Nicely shot - I like your composition and lighting.', '2003-10-18 20:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(454774, 41714, 8125, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big fan of the lighting on this one.  The bright spot on the right is pulling my attention.</td>', 'I''m not a big fan of the lighting on this one.  The bright spot on the right is pulling my attention.', '2003-10-18 20:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(454775, 41400, 8125, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting is too strong on the right side... it might have been better to pull it up a bit - the shadow on the inside of that acorn casing is a bit much also.  I like your composition and placement in the frame.</td>', 'I think the lighting is too strong on the right side... it might have been better to pull it up a bit - the shadow on the inside of that acorn casing is a bit much also.  I like your composition and placement in the frame.', '2003-10-18 20:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(454776, 42026, 8125, '<td valign="top">I like the background color you chose for this shot - it offsets the steel color very nicely.  It seems your depth of field might be a bit shallow - most of the subject is out of focus - although that may have been intentional?</td>', 'I like the background color you chose for this shot - it offsets the steel color very nicely.  It seems your depth of field might be a bit shallow - most of the subject is out of focus - although that may have been intentional?', '2003-10-18 20:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(454778, 41901, 8125, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea for a concealed/exposed challenge.  I like how you chose to show the various stages of ''un-concealing''.</td>', 'This is a nice idea for a concealed/exposed challenge.  I like how you chose to show the various stages of ''un-concealing''.', '2003-10-18 20:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(454781, 41977, 8125, '<td valign="top">I like your background color choice, it works well with the fruit.  The lighting seems a bit bright, or maybe the photo is overexposed a tad bit.  The image looks somewhat grainy to me.  Nice idea for this challenge...</td>', 'I like your background color choice, it works well with the fruit.  The lighting seems a bit bright, or maybe the photo is overexposed a tad bit.  The image looks somewhat grainy to me.  Nice idea for this challenge...', '2003-10-18 20:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(454782, 42042, 8125, '<td valign="top">Excellent stop action shot.  It''s very clear and the lighting is good...</td>', 'Excellent stop action shot.  It''s very clear and the lighting is good...', '2003-10-18 20:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(454783, 41772, 8125, '<td valign="top">I like the use of a mirror for this shot... lighting is good.  Nice idea for the challenge.</td>', 'I like the use of a mirror for this shot... lighting is good.  Nice idea for the challenge.', '2003-10-18 20:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(454784, 41739, 8125, '<td valign="top">Now this is a really good concealed/exposed idea.  The lighting is good, composition is good.  The image seems a bit grainy to me... 7</td>', 'Now this is a really good concealed/exposed idea.  The lighting is good, composition is good.  The image seems a bit grainy to me... 7', '2003-10-18 20:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(454786, 41747, 8125, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done photo - composition is strong.  Looks like an ad for a magazine.  Lighting is good, however it might be better if the left looked like the right... where the wristband fades into the backgroun as it curves.  On the left there is a pretty bright spot.  Frame works well for the photo... 8</td>', 'Very nicely done photo - composition is strong.  Looks like an ad for a magazine.  Lighting is good, however it might be better if the left looked like the right... where the wristband fades into the backgroun as it curves.  On the left there is a pretty bright spot.  Frame works well for the photo... 8', '2003-10-18 20:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(454787, 41958, 8125, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this photo and the lighting.  I am assuming the light through the glass highlighting the date was intentional.  Nice work.</td>', 'I like the composition of this photo and the lighting.  I am assuming the light through the glass highlighting the date was intentional.  Nice work.', '2003-10-18 20:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(454788, 42030, 8125, '<td valign="top">I''m not certain how this fits into the challenge 100% - I hope she isn''t normally ''concealed''.  I like your composition, but the lighting is seems a bit strong, or overexposed.</td>', 'I''m not certain how this fits into the challenge 100% - I hope she isn''t normally ''concealed''.  I like your composition, but the lighting is seems a bit strong, or overexposed.', '2003-10-18 20:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(454789, 41968, 8125, '<td valign="top">Most of the image is out of focus... lighting is good.  With the subject of the image being the moth I presume (based on your title), it might have been a better fit to the challenge if there were more of the motherboard visible.</td>', 'Most of the image is out of focus... lighting is good.  With the subject of the image being the moth I presume (based on your title), it might have been a better fit to the challenge if there were more of the motherboard visible.', '2003-10-18 20:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(454791, 41148, 8125, '<td valign="top">Well composed shot - I like your color choices, the blue accentuates the chocolate.</td>', 'Well composed shot - I like your color choices, the blue accentuates the chocolate.', '2003-10-18 20:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(454792, 42004, 8125, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems a bit too strong towards the bottom of the pumpkin - but it shows well on the upperside and on the stem.  Well composed.  Not sure I really like the black material on the inside...</td>', 'The lighting seems a bit too strong towards the bottom of the pumpkin - but it shows well on the upperside and on the stem.  Well composed.  Not sure I really like the black material on the inside...', '2003-10-18 20:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(454793, 41980, 8125, '<td valign="top">To go along with your title, it would have been better had this been a handwritten recipe on worn paper, slightly faded over time and showing the spills a recipe would normally get.  Your lighting is good - position in the frame is good - however you are not ''revealing'' the subject - instead keeping it somewhat ''concealed''.</td>', 'To go along with your title, it would have been better had this been a handwritten recipe on worn paper, slightly faded over time and showing the spills a recipe would normally get.  Your lighting is good - position in the frame is good - however you are not ''revealing'' the subject - instead keeping it somewhat ''concealed''.', '2003-10-18 20:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(454794, 41175, 8125, '<td valign="top">This is so far my favorite of the hard drive entries.  Well composed, lighting is good, the image is clear and concise.  Nice work!</td>', 'This is so far my favorite of the hard drive entries.  Well composed, lighting is good, the image is clear and concise.  Nice work!', '2003-10-18 20:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(454796, 41953, 8125, '<td valign="top">I think there is a bit too much black space in this image - your subject almost gets lost in it.  Nice lighting and the frame holds it in.</td>', 'I think there is a bit too much black space in this image - your subject almost gets lost in it.  Nice lighting and the frame holds it in.', '2003-10-18 20:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
