(454901, 42030, 7969, '<td valign="top">I like your creative interpretation of this challenge topic, one of my 2 -10''s this challnege. I think the barefootedness, the sort of straggly hair and the blue/gay tone worl really well, my only criticism might be that you only get the one square she is sitting in, in the photo, although the triangle in back does draw my eye adding depth, hmm not sure, well just a thought, i would like to see it the other way just to compare.  great emotive worl</td>', 'I like your creative interpretation of this challenge topic, one of my 2 -10''s this challnege. I think the barefootedness, the sort of straggly hair and the blue/gay tone worl really well, my only criticism might be that you only get the one square she is sitting in, in the photo, although the triangle in back does draw my eye adding depth, hmm not sure, well just a thought, i would like to see it the other way just to compare.  great emotive worl', '2003-10-19 01:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(454904, 41953, 7969, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and lighting in your shot, the white line on the leg and the positioning of the hands, beautiful and subtle, yet bold and evocotive. Very well done, shot has an emotional quality to it. One of my 2 10''s this challenge.</td>', 'I like the composition and lighting in your shot, the white line on the leg and the positioning of the hands, beautiful and subtle, yet bold and evocotive. Very well done, shot has an emotional quality to it. One of my 2 10''s this challenge.', '2003-10-19 01:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
