(454951, 42032, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very very dark. Did you want such a mysterious mood? I love the composition and the patterns of the peelings. Try this shot outside in the shade on a sunny day to see if you can get more natural tones and colors.</td>', 'Very very dark. Did you want such a mysterious mood? I love the composition and the patterns of the peelings. Try this shot outside in the shade on a sunny day to see if you can get more natural tones and colors.', '2003-10-19 03:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
