(455114, 41731, 8911, '<td valign="top">The softness works really well here...like the silhouettes. This would have been a great shot for lighting, also. The sky is so dramatic that I''m not sure how revealed the tower is (not complaining here!), I can see it but my eyes keep going back and back to that lovely sky.</td>', 'The softness works really well here...like the silhouettes. This would have been a great shot for lighting, also. The sky is so dramatic that I''m not sure how revealed the tower is (not complaining here!), I can see it but my eyes keep going back and back to that lovely sky.', '2003-10-19 13:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
