(455266, 41067, 8860, '<td valign="top">That''s a beautiful leaf. While quite a dynamic shot, I think it could have been enhanced by cropping at the top apex of the leaf and the bottom left outcrop. This would increase the dynamism creating some negative space and ''confusing'' the eye - could it be a flame - a strange white profile overlayed, etc. <br/> <br/>Try it - it works for me just using my hands to mask portions of the bottom and right. Nice lighting and colour, although you could afford to slightly increase saturation - again to enhance what is already there.</td>', 'That''s a beautiful leaf. While quite a dynamic shot, I think it could have been enhanced by cropping at the top apex of the leaf and the bottom left outcrop. This would increase the dynamism creating some negative space and ''confusing'' the eye - could it be a flame - a strange white profile overlayed, etc.  Try it - it works for me just using my hands to mask portions of the bottom and right. Nice lighting and colour, although you could afford to slightly increase saturation - again to enhance what is already there.', '2003-10-19 19:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
