(455304, 41953, 10883, '<td valign="top">Good picture!<br/>Nice use of light and shadows!</td>', 'Good picture!Nice use of light and shadows!', '2003-10-19 19:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(455307, 41172, 8860, '<td valign="top">The depth of field is just too narrow for my liking. As far as Exposed goes this does tend to push the challenge a bit too literally for me. Composition is good but colour is a tad on the green side. Using some softer lighting/shadows would make this more interesting and allow a longer exposure and DOF.</td>', 'The depth of field is just too narrow for my liking. As far as Exposed goes this does tend to push the challenge a bit too literally for me. Composition is good but colour is a tad on the green side. Using some softer lighting/shadows would make this more interesting and allow a longer exposure and DOF.', '2003-10-19 19:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(455308, 42004, 8860, '<td valign="top">How very odd! Composition is a little bland and lighting too harsh. Funny concept indeed.  ;)</td>', 'How very odd! Composition is a little bland and lighting too harsh. Funny concept indeed.  ;)', '2003-10-19 19:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(455310, 42031, 8860, '<td valign="top">Cute concept. Could do with some directional lighting to take the brightness off the sliver. It''s a busy shot but it works.</td>', 'Cute concept. Could do with some directional lighting to take the brightness off the sliver. It''s a busy shot but it works.', '2003-10-19 20:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(455312, 41953, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice dynamic shape. Good concept, although I wonder if offsetting the composition to the left would have improved this? You would still need enough dark at the left (or right) side to make it work, but centering it kills some of the design in the shot. This would probably work well as portrait too - making use of the model''s shape to further enhance the composition.</td>', 'Nice dynamic shape. Good concept, although I wonder if offsetting the composition to the left would have improved this? You would still need enough dark at the left (or right) side to make it work, but centering it kills some of the design in the shot. This would probably work well as portrait too - making use of the model''s shape to further enhance the composition.', '2003-10-19 20:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(455315, 41533, 8860, '<td valign="top">Confusing background and subject, but it looks like you''ve shown the full progression of a bloom here. It''s beautiful but the subject''s depth of focus is too narrow to retain interest in the other elements. Perhaps you could have used the depth of field to show the progression more by aligning them (bud closest to the camera) in a linear fashion and then focusing on the final ''exposed'' result.<br/> <br/>It''s just a thought and might not work mind!  ;)</td>', 'Confusing background and subject, but it looks like you''ve shown the full progression of a bloom here. It''s beautiful but the subject''s depth of focus is too narrow to retain interest in the other elements. Perhaps you could have used the depth of field to show the progression more by aligning them (bud closest to the camera) in a linear fashion and then focusing on the final ''exposed'' result. It''s just a thought and might not work mind!  ;)', '2003-10-19 20:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(455317, 41582, 8860, '<td valign="top">What a serene and tranquil shot. Great idea - and you must have been up early to get it. I think it was well worth it. [8]</td>', 'What a serene and tranquil shot. Great idea - and you must have been up early to get it. I think it was well worth it. [8]', '2003-10-19 20:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(455318, 42014, 8860, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot for originality and execution. It presents the subject matter in a nicely designed way with the messy decor creating the textural interest in the shot. Nice composition. [8]</td>', 'I really like this shot for originality and execution. It presents the subject matter in a nicely designed way with the messy decor creating the textural interest in the shot. Nice composition. [8]', '2003-10-19 20:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(455319, 42023, 8860, '<td valign="top">This grabbed my attention unlike any other shot. Obviously not a candid capture but a good take. That''s a costly lens so make use of it - and look after your other half - she''s a diamond.  ;)</td>', 'This grabbed my attention unlike any other shot. Obviously not a candid capture but a good take. That''s a costly lens so make use of it - and look after your other half - she''s a diamond.  ;)', '2003-10-19 20:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(455321, 41474, 8860, '<td valign="top">Definitely the way I''d prefer to see some of the phones I hear on the train in the morning! DOF is a bit narrow and you chose a busy background. Nice idea.</td>', 'Definitely the way I''d prefer to see some of the phones I hear on the train in the morning! DOF is a bit narrow and you chose a busy background. Nice idea.', '2003-10-19 20:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(455322, 42011, 8860, '<td valign="top">I normally hate these shots where you see the photog''s shadow but this one works thanks to some good lighting and subject matter.</td>', 'I normally hate these shots where you see the photog''s shadow but this one works thanks to some good lighting and subject matter.', '2003-10-19 20:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(455323, 42017, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and tones. Nice textures too with a good take on the challenge.</td>', 'Good lighting and tones. Nice textures too with a good take on the challenge.', '2003-10-19 20:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(455324, 41640, 8860, '<td valign="top">Despite the cliché I like the colours in textures in this. I would have cropped off that tiny gap on the left though.</td>', 'Despite the cliché I like the colours in textures in this. I would have cropped off that tiny gap on the left though.', '2003-10-19 20:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(455325, 41271, 8860, '<td valign="top">I love this little fella! Very nice DOF and some beautiful colours with a great take on the challenge too. [9]</td>', 'I love this little fella! Very nice DOF and some beautiful colours with a great take on the challenge too. [9]', '2003-10-19 20:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(455326, 41730, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great capture - not at all too personal. This is a good shot that captures some of [your son\''s?] character at the same time as meeting this challenge brief. Excellent composition and DOF - good use of mono. [9]</td>', 'Great capture - not at all too personal. This is a good shot that captures some of [your son\''s?] character at the same time as meeting this challenge brief. Excellent composition and DOF - good use of mono. [9]', '2003-10-19 20:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(455327, 42024, 1031, '<td valign="top">Color makes it look a little spooky.</td>', 'Color makes it look a little spooky.', '2003-10-19 20:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(455328, 42030, 1031, '<td valign="top">Here''s a case where shooting a portrait from a (very) high angle makes sense.</td>', 'Here''s a case where shooting a portrait from a (very) high angle makes sense.', '2003-10-19 20:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(455329, 41608, 1031, '<td valign="top">I little noisy but captured at just the right time.</td>', 'I little noisy but captured at just the right time.', '2003-10-19 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(455332, 42008, 1031, '<td valign="top">Your emphatic avowal of an emetic esthetic makes me sick ... very funny!</td>', 'Your emphatic avowal of an emetic esthetic makes me sick ... very funny!', '2003-10-19 20:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(455333, 41950, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful depth of field. Focus is really good. The green grasses frame the pod very well and helps it pop the subject out of the picture. The whites are very vibrant.</td>', 'Beautiful depth of field. Focus is really good. The green grasses frame the pod very well and helps it pop the subject out of the picture. The whites are very vibrant.', '2003-10-19 20:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(455338, 41900, 10084, '<td valign="top">The angle you chose for the shot is very interesting. The simple triangle shapes makes for a nice composition. The blue hue of the sky frames the shot well and also has a triangle shape.  Good contrast of the shadows.</td>', 'The angle you chose for the shot is very interesting. The simple triangle shapes makes for a nice composition. The blue hue of the sky frames the shot well and also has a triangle shape.  Good contrast of the shadows.', '2003-10-19 21:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(455424, 41842, 3306, '<td valign="top">nice colors and well composed, but I don''t feel it really fits the theme.</td>', 'nice colors and well composed, but I don''t feel it really fits the theme.', '2003-10-19 22:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(455448, 41957, 6771, '<td valign="top">Very appropriate subject, if you don''t tear stuff apart all the time as I do.  (C:  Nice focus.  Would like to see the rest of the head that is cut off on the left, though</td>', 'Very appropriate subject, if you don''t tear stuff apart all the time as I do.  (C:  Nice focus.  Would like to see the rest of the head that is cut off on the left, though', '2003-10-19 23:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(455450, 42023, 6771, '<td valign="top">LOL!!  What a great piece of fiction you have exposed, I mean, made up!  Still laughing, here!  Very good</td>', 'LOL!!  What a great piece of fiction you have exposed, I mean, made up!  Still laughing, here!  Very good', '2003-10-19 23:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(455451, 41411, 6771, '<td valign="top">this is a great subject!    I would like to see a sharper focus throughout though.  the color is a bit drab, but that is not readily changed.</td>', 'this is a great subject!    I would like to see a sharper focus throughout though.  the color is a bit drab, but that is not readily changed.', '2003-10-19 23:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(455455, 42027, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great fall colors and formation.  The colors are muted and could use a bit of punch.  The focus seems closer than a landscape distance, the leaves of the bush/tree.</td>', 'Great fall colors and formation.  The colors are muted and could use a bit of punch.  The focus seems closer than a landscape distance, the leaves of the bush/tree.', '2003-10-19 23:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(455457, 41952, 6771, '<td valign="top">Excellent set up.  Great idea and execution.  This will do well.  Only thing I would change is having smoother red and blue paint.</td>', 'Excellent set up.  Great idea and execution.  This will do well.  Only thing I would change is having smoother red and blue paint.', '2003-10-19 23:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(455458, 41948, 6771, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  I think this "star" filter makes the rest of the photo hazy, and IMO takes away more than adding to it.  The leaf colors are drained out.  I do see that the lights colors are exposed, too.</td>', 'Good idea.  I think this "star" filter makes the rest of the photo hazy, and IMO takes away more than adding to it.  The leaf colors are drained out.  I do see that the lights colors are exposed, too.', '2003-10-19 23:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(455461, 41823, 6771, '<td valign="top">Nice catch!  Good focus on the eye and DOF back to the hand.  At least it is not a cat.  LOL  Nice job.  Was he tasty?<br/></td>', 'Nice catch!  Good focus on the eye and DOF back to the hand.  At least it is not a cat.  LOL  Nice job.  Was he tasty?', '2003-10-19 23:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(455462, 41441, 6771, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors.  I do like that the focus is on the trees, but the boat might look a little better being a touch more in focus.  That is where my eye was drawn to first.</td>', 'Excellent colors.  I do like that the focus is on the trees, but the boat might look a little better being a touch more in focus.  That is where my eye was drawn to first.', '2003-10-19 23:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(455464, 41968, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Needs better focus, either on the moth and/or nose of the pliers.  Exposure looks pretty good</td>', 'Great idea.  Needs better focus, either on the moth and/or nose of the pliers.  Exposure looks pretty good', '2003-10-19 23:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(455466, 41958, 6771, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture.  Great exposure, focus.  only things I would change/fix is the blown area on the glass and the little specks at the top of the glass.  Looks like it came from a wine magazine.</td>', 'Very nice picture.  Great exposure, focus.  only things I would change/fix is the blown area on the glass and the little specks at the top of the glass.  Looks like it came from a wine magazine.', '2003-10-19 23:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(455511, 42014, 3724, '<td valign="top">Very good eye for the white on white colour, is pleasing.  Composition excellent.</td>', 'Very good eye for the white on white colour, is pleasing.  Composition excellent.', '2003-10-20 01:01:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(455512, 41952, 675, '<td valign="top">wow! awesome kiwi...nice job</td>', 'wow! awesome kiwi...nice job', '2003-10-20 01:02:07.000000', NULL, 0),
