(455525, 41952, 10170, '<td valign="top">I am really glad this won, it is a sensational photo!<br/> <br/>Hell of a good score as well, looks like it was in the lead by a mile the whole way.<br/> <br/>Congrats :)</td>', 'I am really glad this won, it is a sensational photo! Hell of a good score as well, looks like it was in the lead by a mile the whole way. Congrats :)', '2003-10-20 01:06:48.000000', NULL, 0),
