(467682, 41532, 11800, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how I missed commenting on this one. I gave you a 10 because I really liked the clarity of the top, cone and base. It did take a moment to understand, but when I did, I felt that you had done a remarkable job presenting a complex idea. Now that I refound this, I thought I would leave a note. Good job.</td>', 'I don''t know how I missed commenting on this one. I gave you a 10 because I really liked the clarity of the top, cone and base. It did take a moment to understand, but when I did, I felt that you had done a remarkable job presenting a complex idea. Now that I refound this, I thought I would leave a note. Good job.', '2003-10-30 20:44:36.000000', NULL, 0),
