(1384290, 41970, 22551, '<td valign="top">Was just looking though the list of most viewed and came across this image.  Truly wonderful work.  I might have had her arch her back in a slightly different way to create both a more flattering look but also a more curvy look in keeping with your title.  Otherwise a wonderful shot!</td>', 'Was just looking though the list of most viewed and came across this image.  Truly wonderful work.  I might have had her arch her back in a slightly different way to create both a more flattering look but also a more curvy look in keeping with your title.  Otherwise a wonderful shot!', '2005-05-13 19:25:43.000000', NULL, 0),
